1
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:59,780
A little pause... and we are back.

2
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:31,830
A little pause... and we are back.

3
00:01:34,134 --> 00:01:38,150
Ah, just my luck to have lookout duty on a
day like today.

4
00:01:38,834 --> 00:01:41,430
What I really want is to watch the Chunin
exam.

5
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:43,070
Oh, stop.

6
00:01:43,689 --> 00:01:45,790
The Chunin exam takes place twice a year.

7
00:01:46,329 --> 00:01:47,529
You'll have plenty of chances.

8
00:01:48,154 --> 00:01:51,510
Yeah, but this year that kid from the
Uchiha clan is taking part, isn't he?

9
00:01:52,024 --> 00:01:53,470
I just hate to miss seeing that.

10
00:01:54,459 --> 00:01:56,370
Well, my life will be incomplete now.

11
00:01:58,290 --> 00:01:59,290
What's that?

12
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:06,370
What in the... Notify
Lord Hokage right away!

13
00:02:22,380 --> 00:02:24,100
You're not getting into this village!

14
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,560
Dispatch reinforcements!

15
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:39,660
Yes, sir!

16
00:02:55,500 --> 00:03:03,180
The operation has begun!

17
00:03:11,310 --> 00:03:12,490
Lord Hokage!

18
00:03:12,770 --> 00:03:13,770
Leave it to me!

19
00:03:21,510 --> 00:03:22,830
Squad 1, above.

20
00:03:23,070 --> 00:03:24,090
Squad 2, below.

21
00:03:24,250 --> 00:03:25,310
Protect the Nobles!

22
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:34,450
You will not interfere!

23
00:03:54,370 --> 00:03:56,030
Finally, it's my time.

24
00:03:56,370 --> 00:03:58,250
We've all been waiting for this.

25
00:03:58,530 --> 00:04:01,290
I was so frustrated hiding in that
disguise.

26
00:04:01,850 --> 00:04:03,190
You're all sweaty, too.

27
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:04,410
So gross.

28
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:07,010
Come on, we're all friends here,
right?

29
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,030
Sound Ninja.

30
00:04:11,410 --> 00:04:12,770
Right-o.

31
00:04:12,930 --> 00:04:13,770
Let's go.

32
00:04:13,930 --> 00:04:15,410
We have to back up Lord Hokage.

33
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,630
Beware of traps.

34
00:04:16,850 --> 00:04:17,850
Yes, sir.

35
00:04:18,290 --> 00:04:19,290
Do it.

36
00:04:20,290 --> 00:04:21,290
Right.

37
00:04:23,450 --> 00:04:24,470
Ninja Arts!

38
00:04:24,630 --> 00:04:25,990
Four Flames Formation!

39
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:37,210
A barrier.

40
00:04:37,690 --> 00:04:39,010
We have to figure it out.

41
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:40,430
How are we past this without dying?

42
00:04:40,770 --> 00:04:41,770
But how?

43
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,070
Lord Kazekage.

44
00:04:50,970 --> 00:04:52,790
That's a barrier you need to do.

45
00:04:53,870 --> 00:04:55,710
They outwitted the Anbu Black Ops.

46
00:04:56,290 --> 00:04:58,350
And the Anbu are supposed to be the best.

47
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,950
Why are you here?

48
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:04,250
Lord Hokage is in danger.

49
00:05:14,470 --> 00:05:15,990
What a nuisance.

50
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:19,530
An enemy masquerading as Anbu Black Ops.

51
00:05:20,570 --> 00:05:23,770
So he was using Genjutsu... Yes.

52
00:05:23,870 --> 00:05:24,870
There's no mistake.

53
00:05:28,350 --> 00:05:29,610
What's going on here?

54
00:05:30,610 --> 00:05:31,610
Stop it, Gaara!

55
00:05:33,410 --> 00:05:36,050
I must kill him...

56
00:05:36,445 --> 00:05:38,810
There's no point in continuing this fight.

57
00:05:39,050 --> 00:05:39,690
That's right.

58
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:40,830
Don't forget our mission.

59
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:42,430
Out of my way.

60
00:05:43,250 --> 00:05:45,350
What are you three doing now?

61
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,990
Can't you see the operation's already
underway?

62
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:01,460
What is going on?

63
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,520
Tell me!

64
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,000
Gaara!

65
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,320
What's wrong?

66
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:13,060
His wound's worse than I thought.

67
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:15,880
And his chakra is almost completely
drained away.

68
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:16,820
You fool!

69
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:20,780
It's all because you tried to transform
before the signal was given.

70
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:22,440
So what do we do now?

71
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,460
We need Gaara for this!

72
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,240
Alright.

73
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:31,660
For now, you two take Gaara and tend to
his wounds.

74
00:06:31,940 --> 00:06:36,240
As soon as his chakra has been restored,
the operation will continue.

75
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,400
You got it.

76
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:42,180
And you, Sensei?

77
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:44,700
I'm going to take care of these guys.

78
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:45,540
Yes.

79
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:46,820
Right.

80
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:53,300
And is the host of this party Orochimaru?

81
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,080
Don't know.

82
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:57,960
And don't care.

83
00:06:58,260 --> 00:07:00,020
Now let's heat things up, huh?

84
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:04,500
Sasuke.

85
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,040
I'm sorry.

86
00:07:07,041 --> 00:07:09,980
But the Chunin exam ends here for you.

87
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:13,960
You've already achieved Chunin level.

88
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,900
You're a Leaf Village shinobi.

89
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,840
So put your training to good use.

90
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:22,140
In other words, I'm supposed to take down
Gaara, right?

91
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:23,640
Our match continues?

92
00:07:24,250 --> 00:07:25,360
Just be careful.

93
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,140
It's the real thing now.

94
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:28,740
Not a match.

95
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:32,080
What I must do... is the same.

96
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,840
Not so fast!

97
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:43,180
What are you saying?

98
00:07:43,181 --> 00:07:44,181
Sasuke.

99
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,560
Well, well, well.

100
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:51,040
We had intended to capture Sasuke while
Gaara was causing trouble.

101
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:56,060
But I suppose not everything goes as
planned, does it?

102
00:07:57,780 --> 00:07:58,780
I see.

103
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,700
So that was the plan.

104
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:06,880
Then the Hidden Leaf Village... and Sasuke
were your targets, is that correct?

105
00:08:06,881 --> 00:08:07,420
Ha!

106
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:10,880
Do you really think that the Leaf Village
is so important?

107
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:16,080
Now, if Gar returns, I'll be able to show
you something very interesting.

108
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,520
Very interesting indeed.

109
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:25,301
But anyway, your stubbornness and incompetence
have allowed me to outmaneuver you.

110
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:27,020
I've defeated you.

111
00:08:28,500 --> 00:08:29,100
Hmph.

112
00:08:29,101 --> 00:08:31,820
Nothing is decided until the very end.

113
00:08:32,299 --> 00:08:34,980
I taught you that years ago, didn't I?

114
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,480
Orochimaru.

115
00:08:40,481 --> 00:08:44,760
I knew, or at least thought, this day
would eventually arrive.

116
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:51,160
However, you're not going to defeat me
that easily.

117
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:54,920
I told you, didn't I?

118
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:58,220
You should have picked the fifth Hokage
before now.

119
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:05,240
Because third Hokage, right here,
right now, you are going to die.

120
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,720
Orochimaru.

121
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:12,820
What should we do?

122
00:09:13,154 --> 00:09:14,660
Should we send in reinforcements?

123
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,120
No.

124
00:09:16,484 --> 00:09:18,724
It's risky to act when we don't know the
whole situation.

125
00:09:20,099 --> 00:09:23,480
And if Orochimaru's behind all this,
even more so.

126
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:28,840
Is Orochimaru... I mean, is he really that
dangerous?

127
00:09:30,139 --> 00:09:31,680
When I was just a child...

128
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:36,400
I saw him one time and
I... I had one thought.

129
00:09:36,401 --> 00:09:37,401
I had one thought.

130
00:09:41,635 --> 00:09:43,740
That he didn't seem human to me.

131
00:09:44,844 --> 00:09:47,900
That he was just some creature that had
taken on a human form.

132
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:50,840
It was frightening.

133
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,600
Simply frightening.

134
00:09:58,340 --> 00:09:59,660
Sir, I have a report!

135
00:10:01,164 --> 00:10:03,880
Giant boas have appeared near the eastern
gate of the Leaf Village.

136
00:10:03,881 --> 00:10:05,800
And with them, a hundred sand ninja.

137
00:10:06,579 --> 00:10:08,198
They've infiltrated
our village and are

138
00:10:08,199 --> 00:10:10,020
battling our shinobi
who are patrolling there.

139
00:10:10,295 --> 00:10:12,100
Leave behind squads one and two.

140
00:10:12,369 --> 00:10:13,369
And head to the gate.

141
00:10:13,439 --> 00:10:14,080
Right now!

142
00:10:14,340 --> 00:10:15,340
Yes, sir!

143
00:10:26,140 --> 00:10:28,100
This is as far as you're going to get!

144
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:46,820
We've been careless.

145
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:49,420
And now even Lord Hokage...

146
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:51,780
Kakashi.

147
00:10:51,781 --> 00:10:53,380
Look, there, inside the barrier.

148
00:10:53,381 --> 00:10:54,381
Huh?

149
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:55,740
What is it?

150
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:03,460
Orochimaru.

151
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:06,180
Orochimaru!

152
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:08,920
Why is he here?

153
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:12,400
Don't tell me he's after Sasuke again.

154
00:11:14,110 --> 00:11:15,110
Hey, Sasuke!

155
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:18,300
What?

156
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:20,440
He's... he's gone!

157
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:24,540
Huh?

158
00:11:32,839 --> 00:11:37,480
Sakura, just stay there while I trim the
enemy's numbers down to size.

159
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:47,620
Gah!

160
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:49,020
Gah!

161
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:50,180
Gah!

162
00:11:50,181 --> 00:11:51,181
Gah!

163
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,240
Nicely done.

164
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:55,220
But I'm worried about Lord Hokage.

165
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:57,920
Leave that to the Anbu Black Ops.

166
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,440
We have enough to handle here.

167
00:11:59,700 --> 00:12:03,160
Besides, Lord Hokage isn't just some
pushover, you know.

168
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,160
Yeah, but...

169
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,120
Just remember, guy.

170
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:09,520
He is the Hokage.

171
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:11,080
He can handle it.

172
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:16,000
He can handle it.

173
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:24,490
Are you actually crying because you're so
happy?

174
00:12:25,010 --> 00:12:29,090
Or is it that... inside your heart there
is sorrow?

175
00:12:29,730 --> 00:12:34,831
A feeling of unhappiness you can't shake as
you contemplate killing your old teacher?

176
00:12:47,310 --> 00:12:51,990
I was feeling so sleepy, but now it seems
I'm finally awake.

177
00:12:53,670 --> 00:12:56,350
Yes, that's exactly what I was thinking.

178
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:05,290
And I was also thinking that you aren't
the kind of person who would hold a grudge.

179
00:13:05,291 --> 00:13:09,230
So it seems that you have neither a goal
nor a motive.

180
00:13:09,850 --> 00:13:15,710
Huh... I guess... well, I guess that I do
kind of have a goal.

181
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:18,370
Let me see if I can explain it.

182
00:13:18,650 --> 00:13:22,010
I find it very interesting to watch things
in motion.

183
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:26,090
I get no pleasure when the world is still.

184
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:29,150
Like a windmill that isn't turning.

185
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:33,670
I suppose some might find it beautiful,
even if it's immobile.

186
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:36,850
But to me... such a
thing is truly boring.

187
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:39,070
So now...

188
00:13:39,510 --> 00:13:41,530
I want to put things in motion myself.

189
00:13:42,010 --> 00:13:44,570
The first step is crushing the Leaf
Village.

190
00:13:45,430 --> 00:13:46,430
Hmph.

191
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:49,330
I see you haven't changed at all.

192
00:13:54,050 --> 00:13:55,050
Sakura.

193
00:13:58,970 --> 00:14:03,670
It was worth teaching you genjutsu during
survival training for the genin exam.

194
00:14:04,810 --> 00:14:06,970
You truly do have a talent for it.

195
00:14:07,710 --> 00:14:08,710
Huh?

196
00:14:09,370 --> 00:14:12,970
Release the genjutsu and wake Naruto and
Shikamaru.

197
00:14:14,070 --> 00:14:15,770
Naruto will be delighted.

198
00:14:15,970 --> 00:14:18,490
You'll be getting a mission after such a
long time.

199
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:21,430
What kind of mission?

200
00:14:21,890 --> 00:14:23,810
You'll have to be careful on this one.

201
00:14:24,930 --> 00:14:28,610
It's the first A-Rank assignment since the
Land of the Waves.

202
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:37,790
I feel uneasy about that weird chakra.

203
00:14:46,110 --> 00:14:46,670
I'm sure I'll be able to destroy it.

204
00:14:46,671 --> 00:14:50,770
But... Then... shouldn't we wake
Eno and Choji and go in a group?

205
00:14:51,090 --> 00:14:52,090
No time.

206
00:14:52,270 --> 00:14:56,990
I suspect that many sound and sand shinobi
may have already infiltrated this village.

207
00:14:58,409 --> 00:15:02,530
Besides, if you have more than the four
ninja essential to a squad, it takes

208
00:15:02,531 --> 00:15:06,530
longer to get anything done and becomes
more difficult to hide from the enemy.

209
00:15:07,250 --> 00:15:10,730
You did learn that in academy patrol
training, didn't you?

210
00:15:11,190 --> 00:15:12,510
Of course!

211
00:15:12,750 --> 00:15:16,830
With four squad members, that means you'll
be coming with us, right?

212
00:15:17,359 --> 00:15:19,750
No, I must not leave this place.

213
00:15:20,650 --> 00:15:21,650
Summoning jutsu!

214
00:15:25,394 --> 00:15:28,070
Pakkun here will track down Sasuke by
scent.

215
00:15:29,815 --> 00:15:31,170
Wait, seriously?

216
00:15:31,899 --> 00:15:33,310
Our fourth member is a puppy?

217
00:15:36,679 --> 00:15:38,330
Alright, listen little girl.

218
00:15:38,609 --> 00:15:41,490
Don't you dare go around saying I'm just
some cute puppy.

219
00:15:42,764 --> 00:15:45,550
But... I didn't even say cute.

220
00:15:46,169 --> 00:15:47,190
Okay, it's time.

221
00:15:47,490 --> 00:15:49,650
Sakura, go release the genjutsu.

222
00:16:06,970 --> 00:16:07,970
Release!

223
00:16:11,570 --> 00:16:12,570
Hey!

224
00:16:16,170 --> 00:16:17,850
What's going on, Sakura?

225
00:16:18,750 --> 00:16:19,750
Get down!

226
00:16:21,050 --> 00:16:22,350
I'll fill you in later.

227
00:16:22,450 --> 00:16:23,450
Just stay down.

228
00:16:28,995 --> 00:16:31,860
Shikamaru, you were... this whole time?

229
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:39,560
You released genjutsu too, you faker!

230
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:42,300
Why were you pretending to be asleep this
whole time?

231
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,560
I didn't want to get involved.

232
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,420
Just give me a break.

233
00:16:46,660 --> 00:16:48,920
I couldn't care less about Sasuke.

234
00:16:52,380 --> 00:16:53,380
Oof.

235
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:58,080
What the heck?

236
00:16:58,081 --> 00:16:59,081
What is all this?

237
00:16:59,290 --> 00:17:00,840
I lied to you!

238
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:04,819
So fast!

239
00:17:05,319 --> 00:17:07,119
Not just fast, powerful!

240
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,900
Gai sensei!

241
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:16,240
Now I'll explain the mission.

242
00:17:16,420 --> 00:17:19,040
As soon as I do, go through that opening.

243
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:23,020
First, track down Sasuke and stop him.

244
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:26,020
Then find a safe location and await
further orders.

245
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,920
Did something happen to Sasuke?

246
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:31,200
I'll tell you what happened on the way.

247
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:32,800
Now let's go!

248
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,960
Whoa!

249
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:35,340
Why me?

250
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:36,600
What a drag.

251
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,100
Listen, whiner.

252
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:38,960
Huh?

253
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:41,797
Look, if this mission
is a success, as a

254
00:17:41,798 --> 00:17:44,801
reward I'll let you touch
my paw while my pads.

255
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,680
So there's no reason to sulk.

256
00:17:46,860 --> 00:17:47,380
What?

257
00:17:47,381 --> 00:17:48,580
Come on.

258
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,660
They're really soft.

259
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:52,760
They're... what?

260
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,100
No one ever wants to shake.

261
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:59,060
But my paws are so soft and supple!

262
00:18:03,679 --> 00:18:04,300
Forget it.

263
00:18:04,380 --> 00:18:05,380
Let's go.

264
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:13,240
Are they gonna be okay by themselves?

265
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,140
Yes, they'll be fine.

266
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:17,120
Pakkun will protect them.

267
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:20,080
As long as they don't go too far.

268
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:38,600
This barrier can only be broken from the
inside.

269
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:44,600
If Lord Hokage would just take out one of
those sound ninja, then we could help.

270
00:18:45,340 --> 00:18:48,040
Put up a barrier on the inside,
too.

271
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:50,080
Hah!

272
00:19:01,850 --> 00:19:02,330
Hmph.

273
00:19:02,331 --> 00:19:05,050
Doesn't look like I'll be able to get out
of this easily.

274
00:19:06,210 --> 00:19:07,890
Of course it won't be easy.

275
00:19:08,090 --> 00:19:09,170
I know you.

276
00:19:09,470 --> 00:19:13,450
It would be a big bother if someone came
in here and got in your way, wouldn't it?

277
00:19:20,870 --> 00:19:22,770
Something weird is going on.

278
00:19:23,539 --> 00:19:26,450
All the teachers left the students to
study by themselves.

279
00:19:27,409 --> 00:19:28,650
And then there's that smoke.

280
00:19:30,155 --> 00:19:32,030
It's coming from the direction of the
arena.

281
00:19:32,565 --> 00:19:33,565
Huh?

282
00:19:34,150 --> 00:19:36,430
Do you guys see something over there,
too?

283
00:19:37,470 --> 00:19:39,510
I wonder what's going on today.

284
00:19:41,369 --> 00:19:43,410
Yeah, this is definitely weird.

285
00:19:43,874 --> 00:19:47,670
Right in the middle of a lesson and bam,
we're just stuck in here by ourselves.

286
00:19:48,549 --> 00:19:50,090
And we've been in here so long.

287
00:19:50,250 --> 00:19:51,250
Yeah.

288
00:19:51,449 --> 00:19:53,490
Iruka-sensei and the others are late.

289
00:19:54,689 --> 00:19:55,710
Aren't they, Konohamaru?

290
00:19:56,550 --> 00:19:57,050
I know.

291
00:19:57,274 --> 00:19:59,110
I'm gonna play baseball after school.

292
00:20:00,464 --> 00:20:04,911
We've gotten information that several enemy
units have already infiltrated the village.

293
00:20:05,279 --> 00:20:06,279
Then we have no choice.

294
00:20:06,644 --> 00:20:09,004
We should evacuate the students to a safe
place immediately.

295
00:20:09,410 --> 00:20:10,410
Yes.

296
00:20:10,709 --> 00:20:14,010
But we have to do so in a way that doesn't
cause them all to panic.

297
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:14,750
Right.

298
00:20:15,229 --> 00:20:16,850
Okay, here's what we're all going to do.

299
00:20:17,149 --> 00:20:18,829
Tell them we're having an evacuation
drill.

300
00:20:22,884 --> 00:20:24,610
Did you foresee this?

301
00:20:24,710 --> 00:20:25,710
Dying this way?

302
00:21:01,180 --> 00:21:04,820
Don't think I'll go easy on you just
because you're old and doddering.

303
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,920
I wouldn't want you to.

304
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:13,740
Now, depending on how good your jutsu is,
I might send you back to the academy.

305
00:21:13,741 --> 00:21:18,860
At least try to make this an interesting
fight.

306
00:21:29,040 --> 00:21:31,260
Jyurikens Shadow Clone Jutsu!

307
00:21:36,040 --> 00:21:37,500
Summoning Jutsu!

308
00:21:37,980 --> 00:21:38,980
Reanimation!

309
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,480
First!

310
00:21:41,500 --> 00:21:44,220
A summoning jutsu used as a shield!

311
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:47,521
And what he
summoned is... Second!

312
00:21:48,980 --> 00:21:48,980
Huh.

313
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:51,860
I must stop the third at any cost.

314
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:53,280
How's that?

315
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:07,280
So the third one failed, did it?

316
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:09,640
Oh well, no matter.

317
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:31,620
What are you going to do now,
Sarutobi-sensei?

318
00:22:31,900 --> 00:22:33,700
What can you do?

319
00:22:43,770 --> 00:22:46,530
It's been a very long time, Saru.

320
00:22:46,710 --> 00:22:48,290
Oh, it's you.

321
00:22:48,670 --> 00:22:50,810
You've gotten so old, Sarutobi.

322
00:22:51,570 --> 00:22:54,373
Never in my entire life
did I imagine I would have

323
00:22:54,374 --> 00:22:57,191
to face off against my
brethren in this manner.

324
00:22:58,110 --> 00:22:59,530
Please prepare yourselves.

325
00:23:00,390 --> 00:23:01,750
First Lord Hokage.

326
00:23:02,270 --> 00:23:03,790
Second Lord Hokage.

327
00:23:03,791 --> 00:23:06,290
A summoning jutsu.

328
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:10,130
It seems that he used the forbidden
reanimation technique.

329
00:23:10,490 --> 00:23:11,850
How insolent.

330
00:23:13,710 --> 00:23:15,810
Then, Sarutobi, tell me.

331
00:23:15,890 --> 00:23:21,050
Does this summoning jutsu mean we're being
forced to battle against you?

332
00:23:21,410 --> 00:23:23,650
Enough with the reminiscing.

333
00:23:24,130 --> 00:23:26,550
It's time that we got started.

334
00:23:26,950 --> 00:23:30,230
Whenever you live, there's always war.

335
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:32,790
Isn't it great?

336
00:23:32,791 --> 00:23:35,470
Nothing good can ever come of this.

337
00:23:35,730 --> 00:23:38,810
You've disrespected the dead and
manipulated time.

338
00:23:45,710 --> 00:23:47,350
So that's what happened.

339
00:23:48,470 --> 00:23:49,590
I get it.

340
00:23:49,591 --> 00:23:51,390
I guess Sasuke got all impatient.

341
00:23:52,010 --> 00:23:52,790
Oh, man.

342
00:23:52,970 --> 00:23:54,930
Why did you have to pull me into this
anyway?

343
00:23:55,190 --> 00:23:57,010
This whole thing is such a drag.

344
00:23:58,030 --> 00:23:59,630
It can't be helped, okay?

345
00:23:59,690 --> 00:24:01,270
It's Kakashi-sensei's order.

346
00:24:04,170 --> 00:24:07,410
Well, I guess you're right.

347
00:24:07,411 --> 00:24:07,750
This way!

348
00:24:08,090 --> 00:24:09,090
This way!

349
00:24:09,410 --> 00:24:11,030
How long till we catch up?

350
00:24:11,630 --> 00:24:12,710
I don't know.

351
00:24:12,930 --> 00:24:15,590
A long time if they keep moving at this
pace.

352
00:24:15,930 --> 00:24:16,950
Ugh, come on!

353
00:24:19,390 --> 00:24:21,030
Hmm... Hmm...

354
00:24:21,730 --> 00:24:23,031
Hmm... Hmm...

355
00:24:23,970 --> 00:24:26,510
Hmm... Hmm... Hmm...

356
00:24:42,510 --> 00:24:44,390
Come on, you guys, hurry it up!

357
00:24:45,090 --> 00:24:46,090
What is it?

358
00:24:46,470 --> 00:24:47,710
Did you see Sasuke?

359
00:24:48,350 --> 00:24:49,350
No.

360
00:24:49,530 --> 00:24:51,430
There are two squads behind us.

361
00:24:51,490 --> 00:24:52,490
That's eight ninja.

362
00:24:52,730 --> 00:24:53,730
Wait.

363
00:24:54,210 --> 00:24:55,350
No, there's one more.

364
00:24:55,590 --> 00:24:57,430
That's nine ninja following us.

365
00:24:57,670 --> 00:24:58,090
What?

366
00:24:58,091 --> 00:24:59,310
Oh, man.

367
00:24:59,470 --> 00:25:00,470
Come on already.

368
00:25:00,690 --> 00:25:02,150
Gimme a break here.

369
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:12,930
They're probably all chuny or higher.

370
00:25:13,610 --> 00:25:15,670
We'll be wiped out if they catch us.

371
00:25:16,570 --> 00:25:17,570
Wiped out?

372
00:25:18,130 --> 00:25:19,130
Listen, guys.

373
00:25:19,290 --> 00:25:20,730
We don't have much choice.

374
00:25:20,750 --> 00:25:22,250
We're gonna have to ambush them.

375
00:25:22,570 --> 00:25:23,570
An ambush?

376
00:25:23,990 --> 00:25:25,110
That could work.

377
00:25:26,130 --> 00:25:27,750
It would give us an advantage.

378
00:25:28,110 --> 00:25:30,830
Even if there are twice
as many of them as there

379
00:25:30,831 --> 00:25:34,051
are of us, if we can just
catch them off guard...

380
00:25:34,390 --> 00:25:35,770
No, it's no good.

381
00:25:36,410 --> 00:25:40,130
I'm afraid that those ninja chasing us are
Orochimaru's henchmen.

382
00:25:40,610 --> 00:25:43,790
My guess is that they're all jonin level.

383
00:25:44,250 --> 00:25:46,790
I really thought that would work.

384
00:25:46,870 --> 00:25:48,590
But I guess it won't.

385
00:25:48,770 --> 00:25:49,930
Wait, hold on.

386
00:25:50,010 --> 00:25:50,690
Why not?

387
00:25:50,970 --> 00:25:54,710
The level of an opponent doesn't have much
to do with an ambush, does it?

388
00:25:54,790 --> 00:25:56,390
You guys just don't get it.

389
00:25:56,430 --> 00:25:57,430
Let me explain.

390
00:25:57,830 --> 00:26:02,490
Yes, an ambush is a key battle tactic and
can be very beneficial.

391
00:26:02,491 --> 00:26:05,850
But for it to work, you have to meet two
conditions.

392
00:26:06,270 --> 00:26:06,990
Number one.

393
00:26:07,290 --> 00:26:12,190
The ninja on the run must be completely
quiet and must find the enemy first.

394
00:26:13,270 --> 00:26:14,270
Number two.

395
00:26:14,470 --> 00:26:19,230
They have to be able to catch the pursuers
off guard at a location where they can do

396
00:26:19,231 --> 00:26:23,170
a lot of damage quickly and then conceal
themselves again just as quickly.

397
00:26:23,470 --> 00:26:28,150
And it's only under those two conditions
that an ambush can truly be effective.

398
00:26:30,470 --> 00:26:33,361
Now, the first condition
won't be so hard since

399
00:26:33,362 --> 00:26:35,650
the ninja hound's nose
can find our enemy.

400
00:26:35,830 --> 00:26:39,830
And the second one also seems to be in our
favor since we know the geography of our

401
00:26:39,831 --> 00:26:41,670
village like we know the facts of our
hands.

402
00:26:41,950 --> 00:26:46,710
However, our pursuers have studied the
layout of this village and I have to

403
00:26:46,711 --> 00:26:49,990
assume that they've been put through
simulated practices for this mission.

404
00:26:50,430 --> 00:26:54,330
And on top of that, they're probably
masters of the pursuit jutsu.

405
00:26:55,690 --> 00:26:57,830
So they know all the cards we're holding?

406
00:26:57,831 --> 00:26:59,650
Well, I don't really know.

407
00:26:59,830 --> 00:27:02,310
I suppose that an ambush could give us an
advantage.

408
00:27:02,770 --> 00:27:04,490
But so many things are uncertain.

409
00:27:05,210 --> 00:27:07,846
Besides, our enemy is
a special unit that was

410
00:27:07,847 --> 00:27:10,210
specifically put together
just for this operation.

411
00:27:10,630 --> 00:27:12,130
And what are the four of us?

412
00:27:12,370 --> 00:27:13,370
A fool.

413
00:27:13,650 --> 00:27:15,910
A kunoichi with no particular talent.

414
00:27:17,110 --> 00:27:18,150
A mutt.

415
00:27:19,304 --> 00:27:22,510
And me, the shirker who doesn't even want
to be here.

416
00:27:23,230 --> 00:27:24,230
Look.

417
00:27:24,390 --> 00:27:28,950
Tactics are about clearly grasping a tough
situation and formulating the best plan.

418
00:27:29,290 --> 00:27:32,370
And right now, only one plan makes sense.

419
00:27:32,990 --> 00:27:33,990
Just one.

420
00:27:34,970 --> 00:27:35,970
And that is?

421
00:27:36,350 --> 00:27:39,090
A diversion that only looks like it's an
ambush.

422
00:27:39,730 --> 00:27:44,730
So one of us is going to stay behind and
slow them down.

423
00:27:46,350 --> 00:27:51,030
Of course, the one who acts as a decoy
will probably...

424
00:27:54,070 --> 00:27:55,070
die.

425
00:28:03,615 --> 00:28:05,130
So, who's going to do it?

426
00:28:05,910 --> 00:28:08,030
We need the dog to follow Sasuke.

427
00:28:09,479 --> 00:28:10,530
So that means...

428
00:28:18,019 --> 00:28:19,470
Alright, I guess that I'm...

429
00:28:19,570 --> 00:28:22,130
gonna have to... I'm the
only one who can do it.

430
00:28:22,730 --> 00:28:23,730
Shikamaru!

431
00:28:23,790 --> 00:28:25,190
Why does it have to be you?

432
00:28:26,090 --> 00:28:28,430
It's better than all of us being wiped
out, right?

433
00:28:30,370 --> 00:28:34,450
Besides, I'm the only one of us who's got
a chance of pulling off this decoy act.

434
00:28:37,610 --> 00:28:40,150
And of surviving this attack.

435
00:28:40,610 --> 00:28:41,610
Huh?

436
00:28:42,690 --> 00:28:48,130
I mean, after all, shadow possession jutsu
was invented as a delay tactic.

437
00:28:48,910 --> 00:28:51,670
Anyway, I'll catch up with you later.

438
00:28:52,090 --> 00:28:54,470
Go on, get going.

439
00:28:56,610 --> 00:28:57,610
Hmm...

440
00:28:58,630 --> 00:29:00,610
We're counting on you, Shikamaru!

441
00:29:02,450 --> 00:29:03,210
Shikamaru!

442
00:29:03,211 --> 00:29:04,211
Help!

443
00:29:05,950 --> 00:29:09,930
When did Shikamaru become this dedicated?

444
00:29:20,089 --> 00:29:21,410
His footprints are irregular.

445
00:29:22,109 --> 00:29:24,770
Anxiety is probably increasing his
fatigue.

446
00:29:29,630 --> 00:29:30,790
Oops.

447
00:29:32,470 --> 00:29:33,090
Sorry.

448
00:29:33,091 --> 00:29:33,330
Sorry.

449
00:29:33,959 --> 00:29:36,690
I was supposed to be the guy who didn't
want to get involved.

450
00:29:38,770 --> 00:29:42,290
But I guess I'm not quite what you had
expected, am I?

451
00:29:44,170 --> 00:29:46,230
You're right about one thing, I'm tired.

452
00:29:46,510 --> 00:29:48,090
On everything else, you're wrong.

453
00:29:49,410 --> 00:29:50,490
Like our footprints.

454
00:29:51,090 --> 00:29:53,230
This is what I used to make the paw
prints.

455
00:29:56,850 --> 00:29:58,310
Why, he's just a kid.

456
00:29:58,530 --> 00:30:00,410
I can't believe we got caught by this.

457
00:30:01,930 --> 00:30:06,070
So this is the Leaf Shadow Paralysis jutsu
we've heard about, huh?

458
00:30:06,650 --> 00:30:10,130
Yeah, if you want to call it by that old
name.

459
00:30:10,790 --> 00:30:13,190
But I'm afraid you're behind the times.

460
00:30:13,350 --> 00:30:16,030
Now it's called Shadow Possession jutsu.

461
00:30:16,790 --> 00:30:17,790
Old man.

462
00:30:21,130 --> 00:30:22,130
One.

463
00:30:22,450 --> 00:30:23,450
Two.

464
00:30:23,670 --> 00:30:24,670
Three.

465
00:30:24,830 --> 00:30:25,830
Four.

466
00:30:26,050 --> 00:30:26,650
Five.

467
00:30:26,870 --> 00:30:27,430
Six.

468
00:30:27,890 --> 00:30:28,490
Seven.

469
00:30:28,870 --> 00:30:29,870
Eight.

470
00:30:30,410 --> 00:30:30,650
Wait a minute.

471
00:30:30,890 --> 00:30:31,890
Eight?

472
00:30:32,530 --> 00:30:33,750
No, there's one more.

473
00:30:33,990 --> 00:30:35,790
That's nine ninja following us.

474
00:30:37,629 --> 00:30:38,250
Of course.

475
00:30:38,550 --> 00:30:41,570
The ninth one's role is to protect against
an ambush.

476
00:30:42,350 --> 00:30:44,704
That person stays a
distance behind the

477
00:30:44,705 --> 00:30:48,431
others, a reserve, in
case of an enemy attack.

478
00:30:50,339 --> 00:30:51,339
But I know what to do.

479
00:30:51,670 --> 00:30:55,590
This will draw out that ninth ninja and
reveal where he's hiding.

480
00:31:03,129 --> 00:31:04,129
There he is.

481
00:31:08,350 --> 00:31:09,350
Darn man.

482
00:31:09,570 --> 00:31:10,990
The Shadow won't reach.

483
00:31:11,250 --> 00:31:14,870
I don't have enough stamina to use my
chakra to make it go that far.

484
00:31:15,450 --> 00:31:17,690
It looks like you're at your limit.

485
00:31:18,134 --> 00:31:21,450
This Shadow Possession jutsu of yours is
going to fail soon.

486
00:31:21,999 --> 00:31:23,290
So prepare yourself.

487
00:31:23,830 --> 00:31:24,830
Heh.

488
00:31:26,190 --> 00:31:27,190
Ah.

489
00:31:33,390 --> 00:31:38,250
All I really wanted was to be just an
average shinobi, making an average living.

490
00:31:39,469 --> 00:31:43,130
I'd marry a regular girl who's not super
pretty or super ugly.

491
00:31:43,710 --> 00:31:46,570
Have two kids, a girl and then a boy.

492
00:31:47,650 --> 00:31:51,270
Retire when my daughter got married and my
son became a successful ninja.

493
00:31:52,024 --> 00:31:55,930
And spend the rest of my days just playing
shogi or Go.

494
00:31:56,150 --> 00:31:59,870
A nice, carefree, leisurely retirement.

495
00:32:01,179 --> 00:32:03,310
And then I'd die of old age before my
wife.

496
00:32:03,950 --> 00:32:06,050
Yep, that's the life I wanted.

497
00:32:06,190 --> 00:32:08,310
And yet I ended up exerting myself.

498
00:32:08,630 --> 00:32:12,450
I had to go and get myself into this
sticky situation.

499
00:32:14,430 --> 00:32:15,430
Heh.

500
00:32:15,970 --> 00:32:19,010
Well, as you say, it appears I'm at my
limit.

501
00:32:22,590 --> 00:32:23,930
So I'm going to have to do something about
it.

502
00:32:23,931 --> 00:32:24,931
Hmm.

503
00:32:30,070 --> 00:32:30,730
Hey!

504
00:32:30,731 --> 00:32:31,850
Come on out!

505
00:32:32,390 --> 00:32:35,510
And when you do, cut off his head!

506
00:32:40,410 --> 00:32:41,410
Well,

507
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:49,790
I finally caught up with you guys.

508
00:32:50,190 --> 00:32:50,770
Asuma!

509
00:32:51,010 --> 00:32:53,371
How did you... Hmm.

510
00:32:58,930 --> 00:32:59,930
Let's go, Shigemaru!

511
00:33:10,860 --> 00:33:13,760
You did well, Shigemaru.

512
00:33:16,455 --> 00:33:17,455
Gah.

513
00:33:19,024 --> 00:33:20,800
Yeah, but it was way too much work.

514
00:33:22,619 --> 00:33:24,040
Stay here for now, Shigemaru.

515
00:33:24,380 --> 00:33:25,580
You've earned it.

516
00:33:34,459 --> 00:33:35,190
Well, Tomoe-san?

517
00:33:35,191 --> 00:33:36,191
What's up?

518
00:33:36,570 --> 00:33:37,630
He's close.

519
00:33:38,674 --> 00:33:39,674
Very close.

520
00:33:39,830 --> 00:33:40,610
I knew it!

521
00:33:40,810 --> 00:33:41,810
What do we do?

522
00:33:43,589 --> 00:33:44,930
Leave everything to me.

523
00:34:10,020 --> 00:34:11,580
Well, that was close.

524
00:34:13,260 --> 00:34:14,000
Whoa!

525
00:34:14,199 --> 00:34:15,199
What was that?

526
00:34:17,600 --> 00:34:18,600
Tripwire traps.

527
00:34:19,270 --> 00:34:22,520
They're certainly not making Sasuke's job
easy for him.

528
00:34:24,199 --> 00:34:27,840
Sasuke... do you think he might have
been... Oh, don't worry about Sasuke.

529
00:34:28,535 --> 00:34:30,639
It'd take a lot more than that to get rid
of him.

530
00:34:30,790 --> 00:34:31,790
He'll be fine.

531
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:37,780
Now then, shall we begin this?

532
00:34:38,820 --> 00:34:41,803
First, let me restore these
dear old companions of

533
00:34:41,804 --> 00:34:44,659
yours to something more
like their former selves.

534
00:34:45,000 --> 00:34:50,120
And then, if you're ready,
Sarutobi-sensei...

535
00:35:32,750 --> 00:35:35,270
What the devil kind of jutsu is that?

536
00:35:35,610 --> 00:35:37,310
A forbidden one.

537
00:35:38,230 --> 00:35:42,530
It's a summoning jutsu called...
Reanimation.

538
00:35:45,670 --> 00:35:49,950
Normally, a summoning jutsu requires the
blood of the one casting it.

539
00:35:50,550 --> 00:35:55,330
But I've heard that this jutsu,
which summons the dead to the world of the

540
00:35:55,331 --> 00:35:58,487
living, demands the
sacrifice of a living

541
00:35:58,488 --> 00:36:01,850
body to be used as a
vessel for the dead soul.

542
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:07,190
But then the living body is encased in a
shell of dust and earth that takes on the

543
00:36:07,191 --> 00:36:09,450
appearance of the dead spirit's earthly
form.

544
00:36:10,310 --> 00:36:14,049
Those spells he implanted
in their skulls, they sapped the

545
00:36:14,050 --> 00:36:17,330
spirits of their will and
transformed them into his puppets.

546
00:36:17,630 --> 00:36:19,210
Mere killing machines.

547
00:36:22,130 --> 00:36:24,030
Now they're complete.

548
00:36:25,110 --> 00:36:26,550
You demon!

549
00:36:27,050 --> 00:36:29,510
They look just the same as I remember!

550
00:36:30,420 --> 00:36:33,726
Have you ever felt the joy
and fulfillment of humiliating

551
00:36:33,727 --> 00:36:36,890
and destroying the one
you once called sensei?

552
00:36:38,100 --> 00:36:39,370
No, I suppose not.

553
00:36:39,530 --> 00:36:43,270
Perhaps vicariously through me you'll get
a hint of what I mean.

554
00:36:44,190 --> 00:36:45,990
Just a taste before you die.

555
00:36:57,470 --> 00:36:58,590
Lord Hokage!

556
00:36:59,150 --> 00:37:01,210
Don't be deceived by their appearance!

557
00:37:01,450 --> 00:37:03,190
That is not the first Hokage!

558
00:37:03,350 --> 00:37:04,350
Nor the second!

559
00:37:04,450 --> 00:37:05,730
Whatever they may look like!

560
00:37:07,600 --> 00:37:08,650
I'm aware of that!

561
00:37:26,130 --> 00:37:27,750
Alright, let it begin!

562
00:37:28,590 --> 00:37:29,710
Fire style!

563
00:37:29,930 --> 00:37:31,350
Dragon Flame Bombs!

564
00:38:00,140 --> 00:38:01,200
Lastly, let's see you fight a fierce
hikari!

565
00:38:01,201 --> 00:38:01,739
I knew you'd be
successful in this, but I'm

566
00:38:01,739 --> 00:38:02,040
not gonna lose, and
this is what I'll do after.

567
00:38:02,041 --> 00:38:03,276
And I'll teach you how to fight a hikari!

568
00:38:03,300 --> 00:38:05,060
I'll take you to the top!

569
00:38:05,061 --> 00:38:05,520
I'll make you a perfect opponent!

570
00:38:05,900 --> 00:38:06,380
...

571
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:07,860
Oh, there you are.

572
00:38:07,861 --> 00:38:09,280
Earth-style water shockwave!

573
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:21,240
Earth-style mud wall!

574
00:38:37,860 --> 00:38:38,860
Earth-style mud wall!

575
00:39:16,160 --> 00:39:18,870
As quick and strong as ever, I see.

576
00:39:29,650 --> 00:39:32,590
Fighting the two of you at once is quite a
challenge.

577
00:40:14,540 --> 00:40:18,360
Ah, the hidden jutsu of the first Hokage.

578
00:40:21,530 --> 00:40:23,360
Secret Earth Jutsu!

579
00:40:27,460 --> 00:40:29,560
Deep Forest Creation!

580
00:40:47,480 --> 00:40:48,480
No!

581
00:41:04,230 --> 00:41:06,960
Looks to me like this fight is over.

582
00:41:07,460 --> 00:41:08,570
Say, sensei?

583
00:41:15,895 --> 00:41:16,895
We're all here, I see.

584
00:41:17,440 --> 00:41:18,440
Good.

585
00:41:19,255 --> 00:41:20,255
All right, then.

586
00:41:20,505 --> 00:41:21,945
Let's start evacuating the building.

587
00:41:25,830 --> 00:41:26,550
That's it.

588
00:41:26,690 --> 00:41:28,590
No rushing, no panicking.

589
00:41:29,419 --> 00:41:30,419
Konohamaru!

590
00:41:31,100 --> 00:41:32,110
Is something wrong?

591
00:41:32,550 --> 00:41:34,810
You look like you have a tummy ache.

592
00:41:35,570 --> 00:41:36,570
Mm-mm.

593
00:41:37,700 --> 00:41:38,990
That's not it at all.

594
00:41:53,300 --> 00:41:59,700
Ninja Art... Summoning Jutsu... Monkey
King Enma!

595
00:42:11,770 --> 00:42:12,930
Hmm.

596
00:42:13,290 --> 00:42:16,030
So a pesky newcomer has arrived.

597
00:42:19,270 --> 00:42:22,430
That old monkey Enma...

598
00:42:31,180 --> 00:42:32,400
It's you again.

599
00:42:33,200 --> 00:42:35,520
I should have known this would happen.

600
00:42:36,360 --> 00:42:38,320
You fool, Sarutobi!

601
00:42:38,840 --> 00:42:41,320
You should have killed him when you had
the chance.

602
00:42:41,820 --> 00:42:43,440
Better late than never.

603
00:42:44,040 --> 00:42:44,320
Heh.

604
00:42:44,780 --> 00:42:46,240
It's too late now.

605
00:42:49,720 --> 00:42:50,720
Quickly!

606
00:42:50,940 --> 00:42:51,620
Enma!

607
00:42:51,621 --> 00:42:51,700
Enma!

608
00:42:52,080 --> 00:42:56,280
Stop him now!

609
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:58,140
Do not let him transform!

610
00:43:01,180 --> 00:43:02,760
All right, then.

611
00:43:02,920 --> 00:43:03,920
Understood!

612
00:43:09,440 --> 00:43:10,440
Transform!

613
00:43:21,620 --> 00:43:22,620
At last!

614
00:43:30,280 --> 00:43:30,860
Unbelievable!

615
00:43:30,861 --> 00:43:33,280
I never dreamed I would live to see this!

616
00:43:34,370 --> 00:43:35,580
Okage-level combat!

617
00:43:37,400 --> 00:43:39,140
Good for you, old man.

618
00:43:39,480 --> 00:43:42,020
At least you've made this a little more
interesting.

619
00:43:53,580 --> 00:43:54,640
What of it?

620
00:43:54,740 --> 00:43:57,300
One swing of the Grass Longsword!

621
00:44:04,860 --> 00:44:06,440
Are you ready, Enma?

622
00:44:06,920 --> 00:44:12,120
No matter how strong my body is,
the Grass Longsword will still hurt me!

623
00:44:30,540 --> 00:44:32,200
I'm ready!

624
00:44:57,240 --> 00:44:58,640
Fufufu!

625
00:44:58,641 --> 00:44:59,641
Wait!

626
00:45:14,580 --> 00:45:16,360
That was foolish.

627
00:45:17,235 --> 00:45:20,980
Trying to fight the three of us without
using your shadow clone, Jutsu.

628
00:45:22,005 --> 00:45:24,140
Oh, are you alright, sensei?

629
00:45:25,555 --> 00:45:27,520
Don't tell me you're through already.

630
00:45:29,300 --> 00:45:33,400
You, the great sage who has mastered all
the Jutsu of the Leaf Village,

631
00:45:33,660 --> 00:45:36,300
the legendary professor and warrior...

632
00:45:37,175 --> 00:45:39,200
Oh, I'm so disappointed.

633
00:45:43,540 --> 00:45:44,820
Lord Hokage!

634
00:45:46,820 --> 00:45:47,820
Save your breath.

635
00:45:48,140 --> 00:45:49,920
He can't help you now.

636
00:45:56,630 --> 00:45:58,310
Orochimaru, you're a fool!

637
00:46:01,190 --> 00:46:02,190
Let's go!

638
00:46:06,110 --> 00:46:07,110
It's over.

639
00:46:07,610 --> 00:46:10,470
I'm going to snap you like a twig.

640
00:46:10,610 --> 00:46:12,970
It should have been done years ago.

641
00:47:09,710 --> 00:47:10,250
So, I shall take you down with me.

642
00:47:10,251 --> 00:47:11,251
I should have known.

643
00:47:11,360 --> 00:47:13,899
It's useless attacking
their bodies as long as their

644
00:47:13,900 --> 00:47:17,270
souls are bound to this
earth by Orochimaru's will.

645
00:47:18,705 --> 00:47:19,730
So be it.

646
00:47:20,130 --> 00:47:21,630
I have only one weapon left.

647
00:47:21,631 --> 00:47:24,110
The fourth Hokage's jutsu.

648
00:47:28,510 --> 00:47:29,640
First Lord Hokage.

649
00:47:29,900 --> 00:47:31,660
Second Lord Hokage.

650
00:47:32,120 --> 00:47:36,020
Forgive me for using it, but I must...

651
00:47:37,615 --> 00:47:38,900
What is it, sensei?

652
00:47:38,920 --> 00:47:40,560
You look a little out of breath.

653
00:47:41,460 --> 00:47:42,460
Long day?

654
00:47:44,150 --> 00:47:45,150
You poor thing.

655
00:47:45,995 --> 00:47:49,440
All you really want is to take a long
quiet nap, isn't it?

656
00:47:54,215 --> 00:47:56,040
Why are you laughing?

657
00:47:58,070 --> 00:47:59,260
Should I be weeping?

658
00:48:00,710 --> 00:48:03,499
It's sad to see how
old you've grown, you

659
00:48:03,500 --> 00:48:07,480
who were once hailed
as the Supreme Shinobi.

660
00:48:10,380 --> 00:48:12,760
What the hell's going on?

661
00:48:16,460 --> 00:48:18,380
What is that?

662
00:48:19,440 --> 00:48:20,740
What is this?

663
00:48:20,940 --> 00:48:22,600
Who the devil are you?

664
00:48:23,380 --> 00:48:25,420
You have lost it, old man.

665
00:48:25,780 --> 00:48:27,580
Don't you recognize me?

666
00:48:27,720 --> 00:48:30,080
It's me, Orochimaru.

667
00:48:32,080 --> 00:48:33,380
It can't be!

668
00:48:33,920 --> 00:48:36,980
Then you've mastered even that forbidden
jutsu!

669
00:48:42,220 --> 00:48:46,200
It's been ten years of hard work since I
left the village.

670
00:48:47,040 --> 00:48:48,800
You're no longer human.

671
00:48:49,100 --> 00:48:50,380
You're a demon!

672
00:48:53,720 --> 00:48:54,720
You're no longer human.

673
00:48:55,780 --> 00:48:56,780
You're no longer human.

674
00:48:57,090 --> 00:48:58,090
You're no longer human.

675
00:48:59,940 --> 00:49:00,560
You're no longer human.

676
00:49:00,561 --> 00:49:02,560
Yes, he did it after all.

677
00:49:03,140 --> 00:49:06,660
This is why I could never choose you to be
the fourth Hokage.

678
00:49:07,160 --> 00:49:09,520
Your mind and soul are twisted.

679
00:49:23,340 --> 00:49:26,140
So I've finally been found out,
eh?

680
00:49:29,280 --> 00:49:30,880
Oh, such a pity.

681
00:49:31,680 --> 00:49:32,680
Orochimaru!

682
00:49:33,000 --> 00:49:35,360
Explain yourself, what is the meaning of
this?

683
00:49:35,600 --> 00:49:40,120
And after I set all those booby traps to
give me plenty of warning...

684
00:49:40,121 --> 00:49:42,660
I wasn't expecting you.

685
00:49:43,240 --> 00:49:46,240
I should have known you could get past
anything.

686
00:49:46,720 --> 00:49:49,340
A steady flow of people have gone missing
from the village.

687
00:49:49,620 --> 00:49:52,720
Geni, Chunni, even Anbu Black Ops.

688
00:49:52,840 --> 00:49:54,520
Many of them were last seen with you.

689
00:49:54,521 --> 00:49:56,800
And you've been acting rather strangely.

690
00:49:57,960 --> 00:49:58,480
You!

691
00:49:58,600 --> 00:50:00,140
A superior shinobi!

692
00:50:00,340 --> 00:50:01,920
How could you have done such a thing?

693
00:50:03,920 --> 00:50:06,000
Now I'll have to kill you as well.

694
00:50:07,340 --> 00:50:08,880
So you admit it.

695
00:50:09,240 --> 00:50:11,720
Then it is all your doing, Orochimaru.

696
00:50:12,140 --> 00:50:12,940
But why?

697
00:50:13,160 --> 00:50:15,280
What exactly are you up to in here?

698
00:50:15,720 --> 00:50:18,486
Oh well... since you've
caught me red-handed,

699
00:50:18,487 --> 00:50:21,401
there's no point in
pretending now, is there?

700
00:50:22,600 --> 00:50:23,620
It's research.

701
00:50:24,520 --> 00:50:26,140
I'm developing jutsu.

702
00:50:26,360 --> 00:50:29,480
It's forbidden jutsu you're after,
isn't it?

703
00:50:31,280 --> 00:50:32,840
Just what is it you want?

704
00:50:33,800 --> 00:50:36,360
I want to know every jutsu in the world.

705
00:50:36,620 --> 00:50:39,520
And even those jutsu yet to be discovered.

706
00:50:40,340 --> 00:50:43,180
I'm like the one who first took blue and
yellow.

707
00:50:44,020 --> 00:50:47,320
Consciously mixed them together and
created a new color, green.

708
00:50:48,420 --> 00:50:51,580
Only in my case, the color blue represents
chakra.

709
00:50:52,180 --> 00:50:54,400
The color yellow, a hand sign.

710
00:50:54,520 --> 00:50:56,960
And the green, the new jutsu.

711
00:50:57,240 --> 00:51:00,732
And just as there are
countless shades of color in the

712
00:51:00,733 --> 00:51:04,340
world, there must be an
almost limitless number of jutsu.

713
00:51:04,880 --> 00:51:06,180
To find them.

714
00:51:06,280 --> 00:51:10,140
To unlock the truth long hidden from
mortal eyes.

715
00:51:10,460 --> 00:51:11,740
That takes years.

716
00:51:12,400 --> 00:51:13,720
Endless experimentation.

717
00:51:15,300 --> 00:51:20,140
Ultimately, the truth reveals itself only
to one who proves himself worthy.

718
00:51:20,340 --> 00:51:23,600
One who is willing to sacrifice years of
his life.

719
00:51:24,520 --> 00:51:28,660
But alas, I've found there are not enough
years in even the longest life.

720
00:51:28,880 --> 00:51:31,300
This mortal existence is too fleeting.

721
00:51:32,760 --> 00:51:39,081
Yes, even if I were named Hokage, one day I
would die and that would be the end of it.

722
00:51:40,020 --> 00:51:43,820
Orochimaru, what sort of forbidden jutsu
have you been seeking here?

723
00:51:44,160 --> 00:51:46,640
Oh, I think you've already guessed.

724
00:51:50,380 --> 00:51:52,620
Eternal youth and immortality.

725
00:52:02,380 --> 00:52:08,440
The immortality jutsu, a technique for
eternally recycling one's spirit on Earth.

726
00:52:08,700 --> 00:52:12,160
In a way, it's a kind of revival jutsu.

727
00:52:12,420 --> 00:52:15,400
You find a body, a young body.

728
00:52:15,800 --> 00:52:19,080
Pour your spirit into it and make it your
own.

729
00:52:20,340 --> 00:52:21,340
Hm.

730
00:52:22,540 --> 00:52:26,160
I was using my old familiar form until
now.

731
00:52:26,500 --> 00:52:30,980
Because I wanted our reunion to be a nice
nostalgic one, Sensei.

732
00:52:32,660 --> 00:52:36,140
Growing old is a sad, empty thing.

733
00:52:36,500 --> 00:52:39,880
I only have to look at you to be reminded
of that.

734
00:52:41,900 --> 00:52:43,700
You will die here, old man.

735
00:52:43,960 --> 00:52:46,940
While I move on to another stronger body.

736
00:52:47,260 --> 00:52:49,720
But first, I really must thank you.

737
00:52:49,721 --> 00:52:55,000
And all the Leaf Village for preparing my
next body so well.

738
00:52:56,560 --> 00:52:58,340
Now I understand.

739
00:52:58,780 --> 00:53:00,460
It's Sasuke Uchiha.

740
00:53:04,180 --> 00:53:05,180
Exactly.

741
00:53:05,380 --> 00:53:07,000
You guessed it.

742
00:53:07,280 --> 00:53:09,380
It's Sasuke I want.

743
00:53:09,800 --> 00:53:15,840
So you've mastered a jutsu that preserves
your soul forever in the bodies of others.

744
00:53:16,000 --> 00:53:18,420
How many bodies has it been already?

745
00:53:18,421 --> 00:53:19,980
How many faces?

746
00:53:20,360 --> 00:53:20,600
Hm.

747
00:53:21,060 --> 00:53:22,540
Two or three, perhaps.

748
00:53:23,060 --> 00:53:24,940
But I'll wait for Sasuke.

749
00:53:25,160 --> 00:53:27,080
Until he's ripened a bit.

750
00:53:27,380 --> 00:53:31,020
And then when he's been raised and trained
to my liking.

751
00:53:33,100 --> 00:53:34,100
Tell me.

752
00:53:34,140 --> 00:53:36,060
Which face would you prefer me to wear?

753
00:53:37,360 --> 00:53:41,160
Perhaps it would be easier for you to look
on a familiar face.

754
00:53:41,560 --> 00:53:42,720
As you die.

755
00:53:43,120 --> 00:53:45,180
Cursing your brief wasted life.

756
00:53:47,360 --> 00:53:48,820
You monster.

757
00:54:01,100 --> 00:54:02,440
Lord Hokage!

758
00:54:07,300 --> 00:54:11,100
You really shouldn't lower your guard,
sensei.

759
00:54:11,160 --> 00:54:12,560
That's your problem.

760
00:54:12,620 --> 00:54:13,880
You've always been naive.

761
00:54:20,960 --> 00:54:21,560
I'm sorry.

762
00:54:21,561 --> 00:54:22,561
What's wrong with you?

763
00:54:22,740 --> 00:54:24,300
This isn't like you.

764
00:54:24,540 --> 00:54:25,540
I'm sorry.

765
00:54:34,220 --> 00:54:36,120
What are you planning to do?

766
00:54:36,940 --> 00:54:38,760
Kill me, sensei?

767
00:54:41,180 --> 00:54:43,220
Ninja Arch summoning jutsu!

768
00:54:47,160 --> 00:54:49,400
But can you go through with it?

769
00:54:49,540 --> 00:54:51,000
I wonder...

770
00:54:52,280 --> 00:54:53,640
Sarutobi sensei?

771
00:54:53,820 --> 00:54:54,820
Hm?

772
00:55:11,140 --> 00:55:12,800
Kill him, Sarutobi!

773
00:55:12,801 --> 00:55:14,300
Now is your chance!

774
00:55:35,020 --> 00:55:36,741
Sarutobi... Why?

775
00:55:38,590 --> 00:55:40,120
I couldn't do it.

776
00:55:42,640 --> 00:55:46,960
Now I'll correct my mistake and bury you
once and for all!

777
00:55:47,580 --> 00:55:49,680
It's time to end this!

778
00:55:53,020 --> 00:55:55,320
I'm afraid it's too late now!

779
00:55:58,100 --> 00:55:59,900
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

780
00:56:01,880 --> 00:56:03,760
No... Shadow Clones?

781
00:56:03,860 --> 00:56:06,600
He's going to exhaust what little chakra
he has left!

782
00:56:08,480 --> 00:56:11,180
You'll only shorten your life,
sensei.

783
00:56:11,580 --> 00:56:14,380
I think your impatience is getting the
better of you.

784
00:56:14,960 --> 00:56:17,740
Could it be... Is he...

785
00:56:19,320 --> 00:56:23,540
Mie Hitsuchi Uino Ne Toriuma Mi!

786
00:56:26,420 --> 00:56:27,020
Yes!

787
00:56:27,021 --> 00:56:28,780
That sequence of hand signs!

788
00:56:29,140 --> 00:56:30,140
I knew it!

789
00:56:44,640 --> 00:56:47,760
So, it's just as the poor Hokage said.

790
00:56:48,140 --> 00:56:51,833
This is the Reaper, the
face of death, invisible

791
00:56:51,834 --> 00:56:55,181
to all, but the one
who casts the jutsu!

792
00:56:55,220 --> 00:56:57,480
Whatever you're planning, it's too late.

793
00:56:58,000 --> 00:56:59,600
It's over, I've won.

794
00:57:00,060 --> 00:57:01,920
The Leaf Village will fall!

795
00:57:02,380 --> 00:57:05,460
You're forgetting that the Leaf Village is
my home!

796
00:57:05,461 --> 00:57:08,980
And as Hokage, I am entrusted with my
home's protection!

797
00:57:09,320 --> 00:57:11,740
I am head of the household, the central
pillar!

798
00:57:12,020 --> 00:57:15,380
He who would destroy my home must first
destroy me!

799
00:57:15,720 --> 00:57:18,240
And I warn you, it will not be easy!

800
00:57:19,320 --> 00:57:20,380
Yen Jutsu!

801
00:57:20,620 --> 00:57:22,380
Infinite Darkness Jutsu!

802
00:57:29,760 --> 00:57:30,780
What nonsense!

803
00:57:31,560 --> 00:57:33,640
In the grand scheme of time...

804
00:57:33,641 --> 00:57:36,497
You're just a trivial
footnote in the brief history

805
00:57:36,498 --> 00:57:39,041
of a cluster of huts
called the Leaf Village.

806
00:57:45,860 --> 00:57:51,860
In time, the Hokage's stone faces will
crumble and be worn down to nothing.

807
00:57:53,040 --> 00:57:57,180
You've never understood that it's far more
than a mere cluster of huts.

808
00:58:01,410 --> 00:58:07,830
It is a place where every year,
shinobi are born, raised, grown,

809
00:58:08,350 --> 00:58:11,710
fight, and die to protect their home!

810
00:58:36,710 --> 00:58:39,410
These people are precious to me.

811
00:58:39,411 --> 00:58:41,530
We share a home.

812
00:58:42,170 --> 00:58:43,770
We share a life.

813
00:58:44,030 --> 00:58:50,390
And though we may not share ties of blood,
they are precious to me.

814
00:58:50,710 --> 00:58:52,430
They are my family.

815
00:58:59,290 --> 00:59:01,290
The pillar of your village.

816
00:59:01,570 --> 00:59:04,370
A pillar full of termites and rot.

817
00:59:04,630 --> 00:59:06,630
I don't have to knock you down.

818
00:59:06,730 --> 00:59:08,310
You're already falling.

819
00:59:09,830 --> 00:59:12,750
And if I do fall, you still will fail.

820
00:59:12,830 --> 00:59:15,030
I am only one of a long line.

821
00:59:15,570 --> 00:59:18,712
I carry this title in
trust for those Hokage

822
00:59:18,713 --> 00:59:21,610
who came before and
those who will come after.

823
00:59:21,930 --> 00:59:23,990
I am the third Hokage.

824
00:59:24,870 --> 00:59:27,510
You can't stop it by destroying me.

825
00:59:28,090 --> 00:59:31,839
A new and stronger Hokage
will take my place, becoming

826
00:59:31,840 --> 00:59:34,870
the pillar, roof and walls
that defend the village.

827
00:59:37,630 --> 00:59:38,870
Now Orochimaru.

828
00:59:40,050 --> 00:59:45,850
Get ready, for I'm about to perform a
jutsu that even you haven't seen before.

829
00:59:47,750 --> 00:59:48,510
Behold!

830
00:59:48,511 --> 00:59:51,370
Sealing Jutsu, Reaper Death Seal!

831
00:59:57,770 --> 00:59:59,190
I've got to hurry.

832
00:59:59,470 --> 01:00:01,850
This darkness is dangerous.

833
01:00:04,010 --> 01:00:07,870
Well, must I make you show it to me?

834
01:00:08,370 --> 01:00:09,370
Huh?

835
01:00:15,850 --> 01:00:19,390
Are you going to show me this jutsu or
not?

836
01:00:19,930 --> 01:00:20,930
Hurry!

837
01:00:20,970 --> 01:00:21,970
Hurry!

838
01:01:03,510 --> 01:01:06,450
Finally, it's done and not a minute too
soon.

839
01:01:07,010 --> 01:01:08,010
What's wrong?

840
01:01:08,290 --> 01:01:10,450
You're reeling from fatigue already?

841
01:01:10,451 --> 01:01:11,451
Ready.

842
01:01:14,390 --> 01:01:18,050
Now all that's left is to catch hold of
him.

843
01:01:21,150 --> 01:01:22,530
I have you!

844
01:01:28,330 --> 01:01:29,090
Grrr!

845
01:01:29,091 --> 01:01:31,370
I won't let go!

846
01:01:31,850 --> 01:01:33,410
I summon thee!

847
01:01:49,310 --> 01:01:50,070
Grrr!

848
01:01:50,230 --> 01:01:51,230
Grrr!

849
01:01:56,490 --> 01:01:57,490
The

850
01:02:13,290 --> 01:02:14,490
darkness vanished.

851
01:02:14,910 --> 01:02:16,950
What is this, Jutsu?

852
01:02:17,710 --> 01:02:19,050
Forgive us, Sarutobi.

853
01:02:22,970 --> 01:02:24,970
We made your life difficult.

854
01:02:27,790 --> 01:02:33,530
And forgive me, First Lord Hokage,
Second Lord Hokage.

855
01:02:37,590 --> 01:02:38,830
Now, seal!

856
01:03:01,920 --> 01:03:04,140
You sacrificed your people.

857
01:03:05,660 --> 01:03:09,500
You were meant to guide them, not toy with
them as if they were dolls.

858
01:03:10,420 --> 01:03:11,900
Are you finished, Sensei?

859
01:03:12,150 --> 01:03:14,120
Have we had enough of this nonsense yet?

860
01:03:17,320 --> 01:03:18,560
Enma, come!

861
01:03:33,550 --> 01:03:34,930
I've got him!

862
01:03:35,070 --> 01:03:35,470
I've got him!

863
01:03:35,471 --> 01:03:36,810
Striking Shadow Snake!

864
01:03:39,190 --> 01:03:40,190
Damn you!

865
01:03:43,310 --> 01:03:44,810
Now to finish it!

866
01:03:57,080 --> 01:03:59,700
What is this I feel?

867
01:04:01,140 --> 01:04:02,940
This is bad!

868
01:04:15,000 --> 01:04:16,420
Now die!

869
01:04:39,180 --> 01:04:42,780
Oh man, why didn't you dodge it?

870
01:04:46,720 --> 01:04:49,400
There was no need to dodge the blade.

871
01:04:50,020 --> 01:04:51,760
My fate is sealed.

872
01:04:53,020 --> 01:04:57,940
It is a jutsu of the great hero who once
saved this village.

873
01:04:58,760 --> 01:05:01,780
Once the seal is complete, I will die.

874
01:05:02,000 --> 01:05:05,940
But I will die knowing that I've taken you
with me.

875
01:05:06,340 --> 01:05:12,340
So then, this is the jutsu that sealed the
nine-tailed fox spirit.

876
01:05:14,080 --> 01:05:18,380
Inch by inch, your soul will be dragged
out of you!

877
01:05:18,580 --> 01:05:20,240
And sealed forever!

878
01:05:21,680 --> 01:05:24,880
My body... I can't make it move!

879
01:05:29,200 --> 01:05:32,540
Another moment or two and you'll be able
to see it!

880
01:05:33,020 --> 01:05:34,880
It's nearly halfway out.

881
01:05:35,080 --> 01:05:40,700
You'll be able to bid a last farewell to
your soul... but not to your suffering.

882
01:05:41,080 --> 01:05:42,320
For those souls...

883
01:05:42,321 --> 01:05:47,260
The souls that are sealed by this jutsu
are doomed to suffer for eternity in the

884
01:05:47,261 --> 01:05:50,220
belly of the reaper, never to rest in
peace.

885
01:05:50,560 --> 01:05:56,280
There, the souls of the sealed and the
sealer are forever intertwined,

886
01:05:56,360 --> 01:06:01,980
bound together by hatred, locked in
ceaseless combat till the end of time.

887
01:06:09,140 --> 01:06:10,300
What is that?

888
01:06:14,980 --> 01:06:18,140
That thing... is the reaper!

889
01:06:18,600 --> 01:06:20,000
You old fool!

890
01:06:20,440 --> 01:06:24,200
Do you really think I'll just stand here
like a frightened child and do nothing?

891
01:06:31,980 --> 01:06:32,980
...

892
01:06:41,860 --> 01:06:43,260
Go on, sensei!

893
01:06:43,261 --> 01:06:44,580
Hurry up and die!

894
01:06:59,740 --> 01:07:02,600
Hayate... I will avenge your death.

895
01:07:03,260 --> 01:07:04,460
I promise.

896
01:07:09,120 --> 01:07:10,280
That's the signal.

897
01:07:10,540 --> 01:07:10,960
Let's go.

898
01:07:11,160 --> 01:07:12,160
Right.

899
01:07:23,780 --> 01:07:25,780
We have to hold them off somehow!

900
01:07:26,200 --> 01:07:27,200
Where's our backup?

901
01:07:31,680 --> 01:07:33,660
Ninja aren't summoning!

902
01:07:33,680 --> 01:07:35,620
Bring down the house jutsu!

903
01:07:48,120 --> 01:07:50,500
Long time no see, Ibiki.

904
01:07:51,220 --> 01:07:52,340
My, my!

905
01:07:52,620 --> 01:07:54,020
What have they been feeding you?

906
01:07:54,320 --> 01:07:57,000
You used to be such a little squirt.

907
01:07:58,000 --> 01:07:59,120
Master Jiraiya!

908
01:07:59,700 --> 01:08:00,260
Jiraiya?

909
01:08:00,380 --> 01:08:01,600
One of the Sanin?

910
01:08:01,880 --> 01:08:03,960
All right, you baby chicks!

911
01:08:04,260 --> 01:08:06,540
Open wide those beady little eyes of
yours!

912
01:08:06,700 --> 01:08:07,700
Watch closely!

913
01:08:12,420 --> 01:08:17,000
When it comes to dealing with strange,
otherworldly freaks and monsters...

914
01:08:17,001 --> 01:08:19,660
No one's better than a strange hermit
ninja!

915
01:08:21,700 --> 01:08:24,420
Thank goodness that Jiraiya's here!

916
01:08:27,660 --> 01:08:32,180
Now, unless you want to make this frog
really mad, you'll never bother us again!

917
01:08:33,660 --> 01:08:38,080
So that pain in the neck Orochimaru has
finally started.

918
01:08:40,859 --> 01:08:42,000
Where's Hokage?

919
01:08:42,920 --> 01:08:44,319
The battle arena.

920
01:08:46,180 --> 01:08:47,220
I see.

921
01:08:49,520 --> 01:08:51,439
Don't die on us, old man.

922
01:08:54,180 --> 01:08:55,180
All right, now!

923
01:08:55,279 --> 01:08:56,279
Stay together!

924
01:09:01,140 --> 01:09:02,740
Now, everyone keep quiet!

925
01:09:04,520 --> 01:09:05,560
Oh, Komohamaru!

926
01:09:07,240 --> 01:09:09,880
It's not gonna collapse on top of us,
is it?

927
01:09:10,000 --> 01:09:12,100
No way, don't worry, we'll be fine.

928
01:09:12,101 --> 01:09:15,020
Even though this tunnel under the mountain
is really old.

929
01:09:15,979 --> 01:09:17,200
It's strong, too.

930
01:09:17,420 --> 01:09:19,359
They knew how to build things back then.

931
01:09:19,800 --> 01:09:22,859
My grandpa told me that, and my grandpa's
always right.

932
01:09:26,460 --> 01:09:27,460
That's right.

933
01:09:27,800 --> 01:09:30,300
So no worries, we're gonna be just fine.

934
01:09:39,359 --> 01:09:40,920
What are all these other smells?

935
01:09:41,220 --> 01:09:43,939
A bunch of them, all converging on the
same spot.

936
01:09:45,220 --> 01:09:47,800
Smells like we're not the only ones
tracking Sasuke.

937
01:09:47,801 --> 01:09:49,121
There's something else out there.

938
01:09:49,460 --> 01:09:50,020
Really?

939
01:09:50,260 --> 01:09:50,540
Where?

940
01:09:50,979 --> 01:09:51,880
Who is it?

941
01:09:51,920 --> 01:09:52,920
Friend or foe?

942
01:09:53,460 --> 01:09:57,040
I don't know, but... But what?

943
01:09:59,220 --> 01:10:00,560
It isn't human.

944
01:10:13,395 --> 01:10:16,210
Tamari, you take Gaara and go on ahead.

945
01:10:16,610 --> 01:10:17,610
Huh?

946
01:10:18,030 --> 01:10:19,590
You're all worn out, look at yourself.

947
01:10:21,170 --> 01:10:23,070
Go on, you'll only get in my way.

948
01:10:23,330 --> 01:10:24,330
Wait a second!

949
01:10:24,400 --> 01:10:25,400
Get moving!

950
01:10:27,310 --> 01:10:28,310
All right.

951
01:10:30,265 --> 01:10:31,265
Okay, Uchiha.

952
01:10:31,995 --> 01:10:34,170
Time you picked on someone your own size.

953
01:10:37,044 --> 01:10:38,750
Whatever you say.

954
01:10:39,190 --> 01:10:40,190
Hold on!

955
01:10:40,870 --> 01:10:43,310
I've got dibs on him first, Sasuke.

956
01:10:47,545 --> 01:10:48,870
What do you want?

957
01:10:50,990 --> 01:10:51,990
Shino.

958
01:10:52,030 --> 01:10:53,550
How did you find us?

959
01:10:56,110 --> 01:10:58,630
I planted a beetle on you as you left the
arena.

960
01:10:59,080 --> 01:11:00,590
A female beetle.

961
01:11:02,870 --> 01:11:05,290
She gives off a very faint scent.

962
01:11:05,730 --> 01:11:09,370
Nothing you could detect, but the male of
this species can.

963
01:11:10,230 --> 01:11:12,470
He has a very strong sense of smell.

964
01:11:12,471 --> 01:11:14,750
And he'd follow her anywhere.

965
01:11:20,350 --> 01:11:24,170
Sasuke Uchiha, it's Gaara you're really
after.

966
01:11:24,410 --> 01:11:28,090
That is, because your match against him
was left unfinished.

967
01:11:31,570 --> 01:11:34,930
Well, I have similar unfinished business
with Konkoro.

968
01:11:35,150 --> 01:11:37,890
Because our match never even started.

969
01:11:39,885 --> 01:11:42,530
Well, all right then, if you're sure
you're okay.

970
01:11:43,350 --> 01:11:44,070
Don't worry.

971
01:11:44,230 --> 01:11:47,450
Give me ten minutes and I'll come after
you to see if you're okay.

972
01:11:49,470 --> 01:11:50,710
Don't waste your time.

973
01:11:50,810 --> 01:11:52,570
By then, my work will be done,
too.

974
01:12:03,510 --> 01:12:04,770
You clueless fools.

975
01:12:05,190 --> 01:12:07,090
You don't know what you're in for.

976
01:12:08,530 --> 01:12:12,410
Imagine something more monstrous than your
worst nightmare.

977
01:12:12,970 --> 01:12:14,090
Only it's real.

978
01:12:16,270 --> 01:12:19,030
Hm, I'm having a little trouble picturing
it.

979
01:12:19,370 --> 01:12:21,430
Why don't you go ahead and show me?

980
01:12:23,370 --> 01:12:25,090
Oh, it's not me.

981
01:12:25,950 --> 01:12:30,490
If you're ever unlucky enough to catch up
with Gaara, that's when you'll see it.

982
01:12:31,250 --> 01:12:33,850
But first, of course, you'll have to beat
me.

983
01:13:10,510 --> 01:13:11,550
But first, of course, you'll have to beat
me.

984
01:13:11,551 --> 01:13:14,410
I am a member of the Hidden Leaf Village's
Aburame Clan.

985
01:13:15,170 --> 01:13:19,570
When we fight, no matter how puny our
opponent is, we don't mock them.

986
01:13:19,870 --> 01:13:21,930
We face them with full strength.

987
01:13:23,550 --> 01:13:24,610
Bring him on.

988
01:13:42,850 --> 01:13:44,750
Tamari... put me down.

989
01:13:44,970 --> 01:13:46,570
You sure you're strong enough,
Gaara?

990
01:13:51,270 --> 01:13:52,270
Gaara!

991
01:13:57,990 --> 01:14:01,330
There's no telling how long Kankuro can
delay Uchiha.

992
01:14:02,350 --> 01:14:04,090
Every second counts.

993
01:14:05,450 --> 01:14:08,170
If we don't keep moving, the whole plan
will fail.

994
01:14:08,171 --> 01:14:09,171
Huh?

995
01:14:09,860 --> 01:14:11,950
Leave me alone, Tamari.

996
01:14:12,170 --> 01:14:13,370
Go away!

997
01:14:13,710 --> 01:14:15,610
You're nothing but a nuisance.

998
01:14:16,030 --> 01:14:18,830
I don't need you...

999
01:14:29,690 --> 01:14:52,500
We can't take another chance.

1000
01:14:52,501 --> 01:14:54,261
This is what happens when we do what we
want.

1001
01:15:02,095 --> 01:15:03,360
Poison on the blade.

1002
01:15:14,320 --> 01:15:15,420
Sasuke Uchiha!

1003
01:15:16,100 --> 01:15:18,160
Did he get past Konkuru already?

1004
01:15:19,200 --> 01:15:21,140
No, it was too quick.

1005
01:15:21,780 --> 01:15:23,880
Someone else must have shown up.

1006
01:15:24,120 --> 01:15:27,860
I have no idea what scheme you Sand
Village clowns have got going,

1007
01:15:28,375 --> 01:15:30,520
but I'll stop it, no matter what it is!

1008
01:15:33,080 --> 01:15:34,080
Besides...

1009
01:15:39,730 --> 01:15:42,830
I'm dying to see what you really are.

1010
01:15:46,450 --> 01:15:47,510
Gaara, no!

1011
01:15:52,210 --> 01:15:53,250
Oh no!

1012
01:15:53,730 --> 01:15:54,830
It's happening!

1013
01:15:55,110 --> 01:15:57,630
Any second he's going to let that thing
out!

1014
01:15:57,990 --> 01:15:59,430
No, not now!

1015
01:15:59,610 --> 01:16:00,610
Not now!

1016
01:16:00,850 --> 01:16:01,990
No, Gaara!

1017
01:16:02,170 --> 01:16:03,430
Remember our mission!

1018
01:16:03,950 --> 01:16:05,590
We're so alike, Uchiha.

1019
01:16:05,970 --> 01:16:10,290
I don't have friends as you have,
but they're not what makes you strong.

1020
01:16:10,610 --> 01:16:12,590
It's your purpose that does it.

1021
01:16:12,630 --> 01:16:14,230
In that way, we're alike.

1022
01:16:15,430 --> 01:16:16,430
You!

1023
01:16:29,990 --> 01:16:33,070
You are my friend!

1024
01:16:33,530 --> 01:16:35,530
My friend!

1025
01:16:37,190 --> 01:16:40,430
My friend!

1026
01:16:41,830 --> 01:16:44,790
My friend!

1027
01:16:47,070 --> 01:16:48,450
It was Torment!

1028
01:16:54,300 --> 01:16:56,360
You're making this too easy.

1029
01:17:01,590 --> 01:17:02,600
That did it!

1030
01:17:09,100 --> 01:17:10,740
Those damn bugs again!

1031
01:17:13,580 --> 01:17:17,380
You made a clone out of bugs, then snuck
up behind me.

1032
01:17:17,520 --> 01:17:18,680
Not too bad!

1033
01:17:19,060 --> 01:17:19,980
It was simple really.

1034
01:17:19,981 --> 01:17:23,560
Billy, I can tell from your jutsu that
your strength is long-range attacks,

1035
01:17:23,700 --> 01:17:24,700
not close combat.

1036
01:17:25,080 --> 01:17:28,680
Thanks for the dissertation, but I'm just
getting started here.

1037
01:17:29,180 --> 01:17:29,820
Don't worry.

1038
01:17:30,020 --> 01:17:32,429
If you really want to see
how deadly my ninjutsu

1039
01:17:32,430 --> 01:17:35,501
can be, then you're
in for a real treat.

1040
01:17:35,680 --> 01:17:38,100
You haven't seen half of what Crow can do.

1041
01:17:38,280 --> 01:17:40,520
So far, he's been playing nice!

1042
01:17:49,320 --> 01:17:50,520
Poison smoke bomb!

1043
01:17:55,740 --> 01:17:58,160
Must have... inhaled some...

1044
01:17:58,860 --> 01:18:02,400
Meanwhile, the attacker hides and waits
for it to take effect.

1045
01:18:18,430 --> 01:18:19,590
Listen, everyone.

1046
01:18:20,045 --> 01:18:23,650
Even if the enemy shinobi do manage to get
up here, don't panic.

1047
01:18:23,890 --> 01:18:25,930
Just quickly get into the hidden chamber.

1048
01:18:28,715 --> 01:18:29,430
Don't worry.

1049
01:18:29,590 --> 01:18:34,871
Your Jonin and Shunin-sensei are here to
protect you, even if it costs us our lives.

1050
01:18:45,320 --> 01:18:47,100
What is it, Konohamaru?

1051
01:18:48,300 --> 01:18:49,300
Don't worry.

1052
01:18:49,880 --> 01:18:51,460
It's not as bad as it looks.

1053
01:18:52,415 --> 01:18:54,420
Our people will drive the enemy away.

1054
01:19:05,380 --> 01:19:07,440
Hmm... Akagi's face
is beginning to crack.

1055
01:19:08,720 --> 01:19:10,360
That's ominous.

1056
01:19:24,169 --> 01:19:27,240
Now... let me feel it!

1057
01:19:28,540 --> 01:19:30,180
That eye...

1058
01:19:33,650 --> 01:19:35,600
The same eye as before!

1059
01:19:46,350 --> 01:19:47,750
No...

1060
01:19:56,990 --> 01:20:04,990
I'll give it to you.

1061
01:20:05,010 --> 01:20:06,010
Wonderful.

1062
01:20:06,370 --> 01:20:07,770
HA!

1063
01:20:09,490 --> 01:20:10,790
Please stop.

1064
01:20:10,850 --> 01:20:11,850
Dpargan!

1065
01:20:14,810 --> 01:20:20,090
Looks like I may not finish this before
you catch up with me after all, Shino.

1066
01:20:27,060 --> 01:20:29,390
The poison spreading slowly through his
system.

1067
01:20:30,270 --> 01:20:31,510
Now to finish it.

1068
01:20:40,890 --> 01:20:41,490
What?

1069
01:20:41,491 --> 01:20:42,550
More bugs?

1070
01:20:42,970 --> 01:20:45,730
He shouldn't even be moving with that
poison in him.

1071
01:20:50,490 --> 01:20:52,650
Let me put you out of your misery.

1072
01:20:54,630 --> 01:20:55,630
What the?

1073
01:20:55,830 --> 01:20:57,010
What's going on?

1074
01:21:00,050 --> 01:21:01,490
What the hell's wrong?

1075
01:21:01,510 --> 01:21:02,510
What's wrong with it?

1076
01:21:05,150 --> 01:21:06,970
So that's what he was after.

1077
01:21:07,170 --> 01:21:12,250
He wanted me to attack, so he could get
his creepy crawlies to infest Crow's body.

1078
01:21:12,810 --> 01:21:15,470
Now they're going after my chakra puppet
strings.

1079
01:21:17,310 --> 01:21:17,910
Hide.

1080
01:21:17,911 --> 01:21:18,911
Right.

1081
01:21:19,010 --> 01:21:21,530
I forgot these things eat chakra.

1082
01:21:26,890 --> 01:21:29,590
My strings are leading the bugs right to
me.

1083
01:21:33,350 --> 01:21:34,550
And I have no luck.

1084
01:21:34,551 --> 01:21:36,430
He severed his chakra strings himself.

1085
01:21:48,650 --> 01:21:53,430
He doesn't know I can re-establish control
over my puppet in the blink of an eye.

1086
01:21:53,630 --> 01:21:56,350
It's what makes me an expert puppet
master.

1087
01:21:58,770 --> 01:22:01,490
Looks like you underestimated me,
bug king.

1088
01:22:01,510 --> 01:22:06,930
Boy, for the last time, there's enough
poison on that to drop an elephant.

1089
01:22:07,290 --> 01:22:09,110
So, you're dead.

1090
01:22:17,940 --> 01:22:19,960
These stinking beetles!

1091
01:22:20,180 --> 01:22:22,820
They ate through my chocolate strings at
the source!

1092
01:22:34,010 --> 01:22:35,010
But how?

1093
01:22:35,160 --> 01:22:36,360
I don't get it!

1094
01:22:36,460 --> 01:22:39,120
I was sure to cut the strings before they
could find me!

1095
01:22:40,360 --> 01:22:41,840
And there's your explanation.

1096
01:22:42,240 --> 01:22:47,320
You were so worried about them approaching
from the front that you failed to observe

1097
01:22:47,321 --> 01:22:50,580
the swarm of beetles coming at you from
behind.

1098
01:22:53,460 --> 01:22:59,040
All this time, they've been slowly closing
in on you, drawn to your headband.

1099
01:22:59,540 --> 01:23:00,100
Huh?

1100
01:23:00,380 --> 01:23:01,380
To my what?

1101
01:23:01,620 --> 01:23:05,280
When I swung at you earlier, I only
pretended to miss.

1102
01:23:05,700 --> 01:23:08,960
What I really wanted was to plant a beetle
on your headband.

1103
01:23:09,700 --> 01:23:14,780
So then, this bug crawling
on my forehead... ...is a female.

1104
01:23:15,700 --> 01:23:16,700
Yes.

1105
01:23:24,805 --> 01:23:28,540
The poison... it spread through my whole
body.

1106
01:23:30,180 --> 01:23:34,220
Looks like I may not make it after all.

1107
01:23:35,640 --> 01:23:37,240
Sasuke Uchiha...

1108
01:23:41,860 --> 01:23:44,520
I won't let you get away!

1109
01:23:44,980 --> 01:23:47,180
You can't escape, do you hear?

1110
01:23:47,620 --> 01:23:49,240
Sasuke Uchiha!

1111
01:24:08,720 --> 01:24:11,092
The destruction of Go
зан, that's where걑 It's

1112
01:24:11,092 --> 01:24:12,780
only now, the world
will be a living hell.

1113
01:24:12,781 --> 01:24:12,940
Andрас Dahli could keep me alive against
the disappears of thousands.

1114
01:24:13,160 --> 01:24:13,340
I gearsanular mori that can fight.

1115
01:24:13,341 --> 01:24:20,040
Y'all show me what you're made of,
that'd be insane.

1116
01:24:20,041 --> 01:24:21,800
Yes, that's it!

1117
01:24:21,820 --> 01:24:22,800
That's the beauty of the members.

1118
01:24:22,801 --> 01:24:24,860
Fear me, Tonshu Uchiha!

1119
01:24:25,140 --> 01:24:27,980
You live in fear every day I'm alive!

1120
01:24:28,540 --> 01:24:33,820
Has all your hatred and sense of purpose
dwindled down to this, abject fear?

1121
01:24:34,640 --> 01:24:37,920
Is this the existence you live now,
that of a coward?

1122
01:24:38,870 --> 01:24:40,240
Come out and fight me.

1123
01:24:40,915 --> 01:24:42,460
Show me that I'm wrong.

1124
01:24:43,810 --> 01:24:47,080
Prove that your existence is stronger than
mine.

1125
01:24:47,730 --> 01:24:49,800
You'll never know unless you fight me.

1126
01:24:49,920 --> 01:24:51,720
You'll never feel it!

1127
01:24:52,800 --> 01:24:53,800
Attack!

1128
01:25:14,050 --> 01:25:15,050
Good!

1129
01:25:16,890 --> 01:25:18,850
Now we're gonna have some fun!

1130
01:25:19,430 --> 01:25:20,670
Sasuke Uchiha!

1131
01:25:23,590 --> 01:25:26,070
With one blow, I'll finish this!

1132
01:25:28,010 --> 01:25:35,380
With one blow, I'll finish this!

1133
01:25:37,820 --> 01:25:41,240
With one blow, I'll finish this!

1134
01:25:41,380 --> 01:25:42,380
Kara!

1135
01:26:10,240 --> 01:26:18,140
Now it's clear to me exactly why I've been
looking forward to this... this... pain.

1136
01:26:18,980 --> 01:26:24,960
What a thrill it will be to crush such an
opponent, capable of wounding me so badly!

1137
01:26:25,320 --> 01:26:29,120
Such a victory will make me feel what it
is to be truly alive!

1138
01:26:30,740 --> 01:26:35,080
No one has ever wounded Gaara,
and he's done it twice.

1139
01:26:36,700 --> 01:26:40,160
He's a freak of nature, like Gaara.

1140
01:26:41,340 --> 01:26:44,480
But this one's a freak in every fiber of
his body.

1141
01:26:45,420 --> 01:26:49,420
For all Gaara's strength, it's only his
right arm that's been transformed.

1142
01:26:53,740 --> 01:26:54,640
There's more.

1143
01:26:54,700 --> 01:26:55,900
So much more!

1144
01:26:56,460 --> 01:26:57,460
What the...

1145
01:27:07,860 --> 01:27:10,160
What the hell is this guy?

1146
01:27:10,560 --> 01:27:13,160
How many of these things are gonna grow
out of him?

1147
01:27:20,320 --> 01:27:21,440
He's even faster!

1148
01:27:32,760 --> 01:27:36,260
Only by predicting his moves do I have any
chance of dodging them.

1149
01:27:36,820 --> 01:27:39,120
Without my shotting gun, I'd be dead
already.

1150
01:27:41,340 --> 01:27:45,660
I can't use my Chidori.

1151
01:27:45,900 --> 01:27:47,100
Fire style!

1152
01:27:47,380 --> 01:27:48,840
Fireball jutsu!

1153
01:27:57,000 --> 01:28:01,380
Even slowing down... this level of jutsu
is useless!

1154
01:28:02,020 --> 01:28:03,580
You're finished!

1155
01:28:04,540 --> 01:28:06,780
It's Chidori or nothing!

1156
01:28:08,060 --> 01:28:09,100
You're finished!

1157
01:28:27,300 --> 01:28:27,860
You're finished!

1158
01:28:27,861 --> 01:28:30,340
It seems you're good for two shots.

1159
01:28:30,720 --> 01:28:31,720
That's the limit.

1160
01:28:35,415 --> 01:28:40,500
At this stage of your chakra development,
you only had two Chidori shots per day.

1161
01:28:41,110 --> 01:28:42,740
And you didn't use your shotting gun.

1162
01:28:47,015 --> 01:28:50,620
Sharingan and Chidori are a potent
combination, but costly.

1163
01:28:51,320 --> 01:28:54,560
Using them simultaneously burns up a lot
of chakra.

1164
01:28:54,830 --> 01:28:55,830
And fast.

1165
01:28:57,335 --> 01:28:58,335
Don't sweat it.

1166
01:28:58,380 --> 01:28:59,580
I'm actually very impressed.

1167
01:29:00,575 --> 01:29:02,200
Even for me, Chidori's a killer.

1168
01:29:02,810 --> 01:29:07,860
If I had to use the lightning blade four
times in one day, I'd be running on empty.

1169
01:29:10,490 --> 01:29:14,040
What would happen if I tried to use it
more than twice?

1170
01:29:15,540 --> 01:29:17,740
Well, for one thing, it wouldn't work.

1171
01:29:18,460 --> 01:29:19,460
But remember this.

1172
01:29:20,490 --> 01:29:24,066
If you try to force a jutsu,
not only will it not work,

1173
01:29:24,067 --> 01:29:27,700
but the attempt can drain
your chakra to absolute zero.

1174
01:29:28,910 --> 01:29:30,980
Worst case scenario, you die.

1175
01:29:33,820 --> 01:29:37,840
Even if the worst doesn't happen,
nothing good can come of it.

1176
01:29:38,220 --> 01:29:39,220
Trust me.

1177
01:29:39,840 --> 01:29:41,940
Especially in your case.

1178
01:29:49,880 --> 01:29:51,620
Is that it?

1179
01:29:51,880 --> 01:29:58,180
That was the best demonstration you could
make of the value of your existence?

1180
01:29:58,900 --> 01:30:01,480
That's just pathetic, truly.

1181
01:30:05,940 --> 01:30:08,220
Your hatred hits... It's weak.

1182
01:30:08,540 --> 01:30:11,000
You're far too soft and forgiving.

1183
01:30:13,760 --> 01:30:17,180
The greater the hunger for revenge,
the greater the hate.

1184
01:30:17,440 --> 01:30:21,200
And it's the power of hate that gives you
the strength to kill!

1185
01:30:22,080 --> 01:30:23,380
Shut up.

1186
01:30:25,260 --> 01:30:27,820
You know what that means, don't you?

1187
01:30:28,100 --> 01:30:29,100
Just shut up!

1188
01:30:29,660 --> 01:30:31,980
It means you can't win.

1189
01:30:32,440 --> 01:30:35,340
You are weaker than I am.

1190
01:30:37,120 --> 01:30:37,840
CAPTAIN TRUNK!

1191
01:30:37,841 --> 01:30:39,060
Itachi let me live.

1192
01:30:39,420 --> 01:30:44,180
The reason he chose me to be the one to
track him down and kill him.

1193
01:30:44,780 --> 01:30:47,520
I am an Avenger!

1194
01:31:42,500 --> 01:31:44,400
The curse mark again!

1195
01:31:48,900 --> 01:31:53,340
I can't move my body!

1196
01:32:12,850 --> 01:32:16,110
This... This... guy...

1197
01:32:18,010 --> 01:32:19,010
Sasuke!

1198
01:32:22,270 --> 01:32:25,050
What are you doing here?

1199
01:32:26,330 --> 01:32:29,290
He's losing control again, just like
before.

1200
01:32:35,570 --> 01:32:36,810
Sasuke, hold on!

1201
01:32:37,650 --> 01:32:40,550
Kakashi-sensei said that bruise was
nothing to worry about.

1202
01:32:40,950 --> 01:32:45,250
Hey, uh... Sakura... Earth to Sakura!

1203
01:32:46,670 --> 01:32:47,670
What do you want?

1204
01:32:47,970 --> 01:32:49,390
This guy over here!

1205
01:32:49,550 --> 01:32:50,810
Who the hell is he?

1206
01:32:51,730 --> 01:32:53,810
His outward appearance may be different.

1207
01:32:55,350 --> 01:32:57,630
But he's the one you know as Gaara.

1208
01:32:58,710 --> 01:33:01,150
I was born a monster.

1209
01:33:03,230 --> 01:33:05,510
So this is what he was talking about!

1210
01:33:06,450 --> 01:33:08,830
He did this... to Sasuke.

1211
01:33:09,210 --> 01:33:10,290
Hey, little girl.

1212
01:33:10,910 --> 01:33:14,310
I guess now would be the time to tell you
I'm not the fighting type.

1213
01:33:14,311 --> 01:33:16,550
I can see that by looking at you!

1214
01:33:19,030 --> 01:33:20,030
Sasuke!

1215
01:33:21,070 --> 01:33:22,350
So... it's you.

1216
01:33:23,810 --> 01:33:26,130
You're the one I didn't kill that day.

1217
01:33:29,870 --> 01:33:31,070
Guys, get up!

1218
01:33:31,130 --> 01:33:32,130
We have to go now!

1219
01:33:33,970 --> 01:33:35,710
Die, Sasuke Uchiha!

1220
01:33:40,270 --> 01:33:41,270
Move it!

1221
01:33:55,630 --> 01:33:56,980
Sakura!

1222
01:34:04,940 --> 01:34:06,340
Mommy?

1223
01:34:23,740 --> 01:34:24,740
Hehehe...

1224
01:34:26,480 --> 01:34:27,880
Mommy?

1225
01:34:30,280 --> 01:34:33,940
Hehehe... Am

1226
01:34:41,160 --> 01:34:42,240
I...

1227
01:34:45,940 --> 01:34:47,280
Am I...

1228
01:35:05,870 --> 01:35:26,760
Hey, that's so cool!

1229
01:35:27,220 --> 01:35:28,220
Hm?

1230
01:35:37,750 --> 01:35:38,750
Ah...

1231
01:35:40,450 --> 01:35:42,250
What about... food shapes?

1232
01:35:42,310 --> 01:35:43,310
Can you do that?

1233
01:35:49,500 --> 01:35:50,500
Whoa!

1234
01:35:54,470 --> 01:35:56,010
Grilled squid!

1235
01:35:57,310 --> 01:35:58,570
Oh...

1236
01:36:00,230 --> 01:36:01,490
Ramen!

1237
01:36:07,760 --> 01:36:09,370
Uh... cherries!

1238
01:36:12,370 --> 01:36:13,370
Lobster!

1239
01:36:16,690 --> 01:36:19,030
Uh... sea urchin rice bowl!

1240
01:36:22,300 --> 01:36:25,570
How about... a really big poop?

1241
01:36:25,890 --> 01:36:26,890
Can you do that?

1242
01:36:32,530 --> 01:36:33,530
Tamari.

1243
01:36:34,550 --> 01:36:35,550
Kangaroo.

1244
01:36:36,090 --> 01:36:37,090
Yes, sir.

1245
01:36:42,440 --> 01:36:43,700
Hmm... gotta.

1246
01:36:44,420 --> 01:36:45,100
Tamari.

1247
01:36:45,440 --> 01:36:45,600
Hm?

1248
01:36:46,160 --> 01:36:47,160
Yes!

1249
01:37:15,485 --> 01:37:16,720
Hey, Yashimaru.

1250
01:37:17,720 --> 01:37:20,340
I don't seem to get sleepy even when it's
nighttime.

1251
01:37:20,850 --> 01:37:21,850
Why is that?

1252
01:37:23,410 --> 01:37:25,040
Now, that's a problem.

1253
01:37:26,860 --> 01:37:29,760
Normally, when you close your eyes,
you should get tired.

1254
01:37:29,761 --> 01:37:31,120
Oh, really?

1255
01:37:35,630 --> 01:37:37,641
Hey... why... Hm?

1256
01:37:38,580 --> 01:37:40,120
Why don't I have a mother?

1257
01:37:40,850 --> 01:37:41,850
Oh, uh...

1258
01:37:44,290 --> 01:37:47,460
Instead of a mother, you get to have me,
Lord Gaara.

1259
01:37:49,730 --> 01:37:54,100
And that... is because I'm going to remain
by your side... always.

1260
01:37:55,080 --> 01:37:56,761
Hm... It's fine...

1261
01:38:09,510 --> 01:38:11,610
Hm... Oh... And
your turn will come.

1262
01:38:11,611 --> 01:38:12,611
Hey...

1263
01:38:18,480 --> 01:38:19,480
Oh?

1264
01:38:20,860 --> 01:38:21,860
Hm?

1265
01:38:28,520 --> 01:38:29,520
Hm?

1266
01:38:51,560 --> 01:38:54,010
Oh... Is it lunchtime?

1267
01:38:54,230 --> 01:38:55,230
Mm-hm?

1268
01:38:55,370 --> 01:38:56,370
Ah...

1269
01:38:57,650 --> 01:38:58,410
Yeah!

1270
01:38:58,670 --> 01:38:59,330
Good kick!

1271
01:38:59,690 --> 01:38:59,910
Yeah!

1272
01:39:00,010 --> 01:39:00,290
Good kick!

1273
01:39:00,291 --> 01:39:00,530
Ouch!

1274
01:39:00,531 --> 01:39:00,570
It hurts!

1275
01:39:00,710 --> 01:39:01,710
Ouch!

1276
01:39:10,495 --> 01:39:12,550
Oh man, now what do we do?

1277
01:39:13,710 --> 01:39:15,510
I don't know any wall climbing,
Jutsu.

1278
01:39:15,650 --> 01:39:16,650
Do you?

1279
01:39:25,420 --> 01:39:26,420
It's him!

1280
01:39:32,170 --> 01:39:33,170
Here.

1281
01:39:35,490 --> 01:39:36,510
It's that Gaara!

1282
01:39:38,910 --> 01:39:39,150
Run!

1283
01:39:39,410 --> 01:39:40,050
Run!

1284
01:39:40,270 --> 01:39:40,910
Hurry!

1285
01:39:41,130 --> 01:39:45,670
Let's get out of here!

1286
01:39:46,010 --> 01:39:46,710
No, wait!

1287
01:39:47,030 --> 01:39:47,450
Run!

1288
01:39:47,550 --> 01:39:48,550
Don't run away!

1289
01:39:53,340 --> 01:39:54,340
Please.

1290
01:39:55,620 --> 01:39:58,100
I don't want to be alone anymore.

1291
01:39:59,660 --> 01:40:01,180
Let me go!

1292
01:40:05,740 --> 01:40:06,920
Never again.

1293
01:40:08,540 --> 01:40:09,780
Stop it, please!

1294
01:40:15,580 --> 01:40:16,440
No, Gaara!

1295
01:40:16,540 --> 01:40:17,820
You can't do this!

1296
01:40:21,120 --> 01:40:22,120
Yoshimaru...

1297
01:40:35,830 --> 01:40:37,850
It doesn't matter what I do.

1298
01:40:38,490 --> 01:40:40,490
The sand just gets in the way.

1299
01:40:42,570 --> 01:40:43,570
Gaara...

1300
01:40:44,970 --> 01:40:45,970
Yoshimaru...

1301
01:40:46,645 --> 01:40:51,470
As a member of the Medical Corps,
our leader, Lord Kazekage, has asked that

1302
01:40:51,471 --> 01:40:53,710
I see to your safety and well-being
personally.

1303
01:40:54,710 --> 01:40:55,710
Please, Gaara.

1304
01:40:56,060 --> 01:40:57,470
It hurts me to see you do that.

1305
01:41:00,610 --> 01:41:02,270
Yoshimaru... I'm sorry.

1306
01:41:02,570 --> 01:41:03,570
What?

1307
01:41:03,790 --> 01:41:04,450
This?

1308
01:41:04,780 --> 01:41:05,780
Don't worry.

1309
01:41:06,245 --> 01:41:07,525
It's barely more than a scratch.

1310
01:41:10,240 --> 01:41:13,310
The wound you got... does it hurt?

1311
01:41:14,290 --> 01:41:17,130
Yes, a little bit.

1312
01:41:17,920 --> 01:41:19,150
But it'll heal in no time.

1313
01:41:22,080 --> 01:41:23,970
What does pain feel like?

1314
01:41:24,210 --> 01:41:24,370
Hm?

1315
01:41:24,371 --> 01:41:29,890
You see, I've never actually been injured
before.

1316
01:41:30,310 --> 01:41:32,770
And I was wondering what it was like.

1317
01:41:34,630 --> 01:41:36,490
Hm... How can I put it?

1318
01:41:36,530 --> 01:41:41,030
It's very difficult, or maybe upsetting's
what I mean.

1319
01:41:42,005 --> 01:41:45,330
It's like when someone is struck or cut.

1320
01:41:45,705 --> 01:41:47,890
It's a feeling that's very hard to take.

1321
01:41:48,370 --> 01:41:50,790
When you're hurt, you don't feel normal.

1322
01:41:52,740 --> 01:41:54,430
I'm not explaining it very well.

1323
01:41:54,610 --> 01:41:58,090
Basically, it's a situation you want to
avoid, if at all possible.

1324
01:42:00,480 --> 01:42:02,810
I think I might be hurting, too.

1325
01:42:03,740 --> 01:42:05,370
Just like everyone else.

1326
01:42:05,570 --> 01:42:10,590
I know I'm not bleeding, but lately I've
felt a lot of pain here.

1327
01:42:18,245 --> 01:42:19,245
SHOOK

1328
01:42:24,280 --> 01:42:32,280
I've always felt like I was hurting,
but I can't help it.

1329
01:42:34,260 --> 01:42:38,200
I feel like my heart feels like it's going
to break.

1330
01:42:38,300 --> 01:42:39,340
I guess that's no problem.

1331
01:42:41,940 --> 01:42:45,980
I've been there, I've felt that way.

1332
01:42:45,981 --> 01:42:47,020
From wounds to the flesh.

1333
01:42:47,995 --> 01:42:50,649
Unlike an injury to the
body, there is no medicine

1334
01:42:50,650 --> 01:42:53,260
for a wounded heart, and
sometimes it never heals.

1335
01:43:00,360 --> 01:43:01,360
But don't worry.

1336
01:43:01,995 --> 01:43:04,410
There is one thing that can mend a broken
heart.

1337
01:43:05,490 --> 01:43:08,130
But it's a very complicated remedy.

1338
01:43:08,795 --> 01:43:11,430
It can only be administered to you by
another person.

1339
01:43:11,630 --> 01:43:13,770
So then, what am I supposed to do?

1340
01:43:14,795 --> 01:43:16,810
There's one thing that can heal the heart.

1341
01:43:17,470 --> 01:43:18,470
Only one.

1342
01:43:21,635 --> 01:43:22,870
It's love, Gaara.

1343
01:43:23,870 --> 01:43:24,870
Love?

1344
01:43:25,190 --> 01:43:26,190
You've got it.

1345
01:43:26,350 --> 01:43:28,730
But... but how am I supposed to get rid of
it?

1346
01:43:29,095 --> 01:43:31,130
What is it I have to do to get rid of this
pain?

1347
01:43:31,450 --> 01:43:32,570
Don't you know, Gaara?

1348
01:43:33,070 --> 01:43:34,990
It has already been given to you.

1349
01:43:36,050 --> 01:43:44,050
Love is... the heart's desire to serve
someone precious to you.

1350
01:43:44,380 --> 01:43:45,650
To watch over them.

1351
01:43:46,050 --> 01:43:47,110
To care for them.

1352
01:43:47,529 --> 01:43:49,150
Like my sister did for you.

1353
01:43:49,830 --> 01:43:53,630
There's no question that my older sister
always loved you.

1354
01:43:54,290 --> 01:43:59,070
The sand automatically rushes to protect
you, just like the love of a mother.

1355
01:43:59,840 --> 01:44:04,030
I believe your mother's will is carried in
every grain of that sand.

1356
01:44:06,330 --> 01:44:12,150
My sister, even after death, wants more
than anything to protect you.

1357
01:44:16,190 --> 01:44:16,830
Yashimaru...

1358
01:44:16,980 --> 01:44:18,370
What is it, Gaara?

1359
01:44:19,680 --> 01:44:21,330
Thank you for all of your help.

1360
01:44:21,990 --> 01:44:23,530
You know, for stopping me before.

1361
01:44:24,810 --> 01:44:25,810
You're very welcome.

1362
01:44:27,330 --> 01:44:29,630
After all, you're special, Gaara.

1363
01:44:29,690 --> 01:44:31,090
I hold you very dear to me.

1364
01:44:42,250 --> 01:44:45,320
Can you understand the pain that I feel?

1365
01:44:52,310 --> 01:44:54,290
It tastes like iron.

1366
01:44:57,710 --> 01:44:58,750
Hey, Yashimaru.

1367
01:44:59,110 --> 01:45:00,810
I have a favor to ask.

1368
01:45:01,559 --> 01:45:02,559
What is it?

1369
01:45:03,310 --> 01:45:05,170
I need some of your medicine.

1370
01:45:15,485 --> 01:45:16,800
Sorry about earlier.

1371
01:45:17,650 --> 01:45:18,780
I know it must have hurt.

1372
01:45:19,450 --> 01:45:22,260
I brought you some medicine, if you want.

1373
01:45:22,540 --> 01:45:23,540
Get out of here!

1374
01:45:23,960 --> 01:45:24,960
Freak!

1375
01:45:36,980 --> 01:45:37,980
I was right.

1376
01:45:39,135 --> 01:45:40,410
No one wants me.

1377
01:45:43,510 --> 01:45:44,510
Why?

1378
01:45:45,130 --> 01:45:47,610
Why do I have to be such a freak?

1379
01:45:48,910 --> 01:45:50,590
What am I?

1380
01:45:52,510 --> 01:45:56,410
Only one thing cures a wounded heart,
and that's love, Gaara.

1381
01:45:59,250 --> 01:46:00,250
Yashimaru...

1382
01:46:14,090 --> 01:46:16,350
Yashimaru... Why... why me?

1383
01:46:16,890 --> 01:46:18,870
Why is it always me?

1384
01:46:24,530 --> 01:46:25,970
I have

1385
01:46:36,940 --> 01:46:44,940
met the cuidado of an adult before.

1386
01:46:45,020 --> 01:46:45,020
a chance to myself.

1387
01:46:45,021 --> 01:46:46,021
No...

1388
01:46:59,680 --> 01:47:01,620
You did well, Gaara.

1389
01:47:02,930 --> 01:47:03,930
You did very well.

1390
01:47:07,080 --> 01:47:08,080
Why?

1391
01:47:09,920 --> 01:47:12,880
Yoshimaru, why did you do it?

1392
01:47:13,820 --> 01:47:15,620
I don't understand.

1393
01:47:20,820 --> 01:47:28,820
You see, I was ordered to kill you,
Gaara, by Lord Kazekage, your father.

1394
01:47:32,920 --> 01:47:34,840
My father...

1395
01:47:41,980 --> 01:47:43,460
Why me?

1396
01:47:43,620 --> 01:47:46,640
Why would... my father...

1397
01:47:47,420 --> 01:47:52,180
All these years you have been watched and
studied as part of a great experiment.

1398
01:47:53,440 --> 01:47:56,821
It became clear that you
could never control it, the

1399
01:47:56,822 --> 01:48:00,500
Shukaku that possesses
the power of the sand itself.

1400
01:48:01,720 --> 01:48:06,980
The day is coming when your existence will
be too dangerous for the village.

1401
01:48:07,780 --> 01:48:10,440
It had to be done before then.

1402
01:48:12,760 --> 01:48:15,800
You... you had to obey my father.

1403
01:48:16,640 --> 01:48:18,460
You didn't have any choice.

1404
01:48:19,960 --> 01:48:20,960
You're wrong.

1405
01:48:21,280 --> 01:48:22,900
I had a choice.

1406
01:48:24,960 --> 01:48:28,480
Yes, Lord Kazekage made his wishes known
to me.

1407
01:48:29,340 --> 01:48:32,520
But I could have refused if I had chosen
to.

1408
01:48:35,810 --> 01:48:41,700
I suppose it's because, deep in my heart,
I hate you, Gaara.

1409
01:48:43,220 --> 01:48:45,300
I've always hated you.

1410
01:48:47,210 --> 01:48:49,960
My sister died bringing you into this
world.

1411
01:48:50,870 --> 01:48:52,420
I can't forgive you for that.

1412
01:48:53,970 --> 01:48:56,500
I told myself that you were all that was
left of her.

1413
01:48:56,760 --> 01:48:59,880
And since I loved her, I should love you.

1414
01:49:00,985 --> 01:49:03,460
I tried, but I never could.

1415
01:49:04,600 --> 01:49:09,600
It wasn't her choice to have you... to be
made a human sacrifice.

1416
01:49:10,610 --> 01:49:13,500
And so she died cursing this village.

1417
01:49:14,420 --> 01:49:20,560
The day she died, I felt a wound in my
heart that I knew would never heal.

1418
01:49:21,940 --> 01:49:25,420
Your name is... the one your mother gave
you.

1419
01:49:27,680 --> 01:49:29,220
Your name is Gaara.

1420
01:49:29,680 --> 01:49:31,860
The demon that loves only itself.

1421
01:49:32,640 --> 01:49:35,460
As you must love no one else.

1422
01:49:36,040 --> 01:49:38,800
Care for no one's existence but your own.

1423
01:49:39,380 --> 01:49:41,520
Fight only for yourself.

1424
01:49:41,521 --> 01:49:44,820
In that way, you will be sure to survive.

1425
01:49:45,860 --> 01:49:48,740
This is the dying gift your mother left
you.

1426
01:49:49,220 --> 01:49:51,260
But not out of maternal affection.

1427
01:49:52,240 --> 01:49:55,660
It was not from love that she gave you
your name.

1428
01:49:58,780 --> 01:50:02,520
It was from her undying rage at this
village.

1429
01:50:03,040 --> 01:50:05,020
It was part of her curse.

1430
01:50:05,840 --> 01:50:08,140
That you should survive and grow.

1431
01:50:11,520 --> 01:50:13,480
Her hate lives on in you.

1432
01:50:29,670 --> 01:50:31,900
You were never loved, Gaara.

1433
01:50:33,140 --> 01:50:34,140
Never.

1434
01:50:41,000 --> 01:50:42,540
This is the end.

1435
01:51:03,960 --> 01:51:06,760
The End She always loved you.

1436
01:51:07,560 --> 01:51:08,600
Love?

1437
01:51:19,760 --> 01:51:32,240
G-G-G-G-A little pause.

1438
01:51:46,230 --> 01:51:49,750
..

1439
01:51:49,751 --> 01:51:50,751
and we are back.

1440
01:52:11,790 --> 01:52:19,790
A little pause... and we are back.

1441
01:52:20,950 --> 01:52:23,910
I am all that matters.

1442
01:52:30,250 --> 01:52:32,170
Those eyes!

1443
01:52:35,310 --> 01:52:36,910
What's the matter?

1444
01:52:37,610 --> 01:52:40,030
Weren't you about to make a run for it?

1445
01:52:41,810 --> 01:52:42,810
Sasuke!

1446
01:52:45,010 --> 01:52:46,010
Naruto!

1447
01:52:50,030 --> 01:52:51,630
Who are these two?

1448
01:52:53,810 --> 01:52:55,610
Who are they to you?

1449
01:52:56,170 --> 01:52:57,170
Huh?

1450
01:52:57,930 --> 01:52:59,210
Who are they to me?

1451
01:52:59,450 --> 01:53:01,450
They're my friends is who they are!

1452
01:53:01,710 --> 01:53:07,911
You try laying so much as another finger on
the two of them, and I will pulverize you!

1453
01:53:13,350 --> 01:53:14,430
What's the matter?

1454
01:53:15,310 --> 01:53:17,770
Weren't you gonna pulverize me?

1455
01:53:20,550 --> 01:53:22,030
Well, come on, then!

1456
01:53:29,990 --> 01:53:30,990
Damnit!

1457
01:53:38,700 --> 01:53:39,760
This guy!

1458
01:53:48,280 --> 01:53:51,340
This isn't gonna be easy as long as he
stays like this.

1459
01:53:54,540 --> 01:53:56,220
I have no choice.

1460
01:53:58,200 --> 01:54:01,600
This is gonna use up a
heck of a lot of chakra,

1461
01:54:01,601 --> 01:54:05,100
but it's time to bring
in the Chief Toad!

1462
01:54:07,540 --> 01:54:08,540
Summoning Jutsu!

1463
01:54:13,160 --> 01:54:14,160
What is it?

1464
01:54:14,240 --> 01:54:15,240
What do you want, kid?

1465
01:54:15,640 --> 01:54:17,960
Well, whatever it is, I hope you brought
along some treats.

1466
01:54:18,050 --> 01:54:20,160
Cause if you think I'm doing anything for
nothing, you're wrong!

1467
01:54:20,161 --> 01:54:20,660
No!

1468
01:54:20,661 --> 01:54:21,661
Give me a break!

1469
01:54:21,700 --> 01:54:23,940
I'm really starting to hate you stinking
frogs!

1470
01:54:24,340 --> 01:54:24,700
Ho ho ho!

1471
01:54:24,840 --> 01:54:25,840
Anti-Amphibian, huh?

1472
01:54:25,940 --> 01:54:27,180
Well, take that, you big bigot!

1473
01:54:27,940 --> 01:54:28,940
Listen!

1474
01:54:29,000 --> 01:54:31,800
I don't have time to play games,
you slimy little squirt!

1475
01:54:33,980 --> 01:54:35,300
I can't believe it!

1476
01:54:35,620 --> 01:54:38,300
After all my training, this is the best I
can do?

1477
01:54:38,640 --> 01:54:40,360
I'll just have to make it work!

1478
01:54:40,720 --> 01:54:42,840
I'm the only one who can save them!

1479
01:54:44,100 --> 01:54:45,520
Worried about the others?

1480
01:54:46,020 --> 01:54:47,640
That's your big mistake!

1481
01:54:47,641 --> 01:54:51,440
When I fight, I fight for me and me alone!

1482
01:54:57,580 --> 01:54:59,440
He's transforming again!

1483
01:55:02,800 --> 01:55:06,860
Only by attacking and defeating me can you
free her.

1484
01:55:07,140 --> 01:55:08,740
And you should hurry.

1485
01:55:08,900 --> 01:55:14,320
With each passing second, the sand will
harden until it crushes her to death.

1486
01:55:16,520 --> 01:55:17,080
Sakura!

1487
01:55:17,081 --> 01:55:20,380
He's getting closer and closer to a total
possession.

1488
01:55:21,500 --> 01:55:24,840
And if that happens, none of us will
survive.

1489
01:55:26,480 --> 01:55:27,600
Sand shuriken!

1490
01:55:33,520 --> 01:55:34,520
Wow!

1491
01:55:37,980 --> 01:55:38,980
Boy, are you pathetic!

1492
01:55:39,620 --> 01:55:40,420
Shut up!

1493
01:55:40,620 --> 01:55:42,480
So, uh, who the heck is this freak anyway?

1494
01:55:42,481 --> 01:55:43,481
Huh!

1495
01:55:52,555 --> 01:55:53,820
Eyes full of loneliness.

1496
01:55:54,980 --> 01:55:58,800
I don't know how it happened, but this
guy's been there.

1497
01:55:58,920 --> 01:55:59,920
All alone.

1498
01:56:00,140 --> 01:56:03,360
In that same bottomless pit of darkness
and pain.

1499
01:56:03,920 --> 01:56:05,360
He's still there.

1500
01:56:05,800 --> 01:56:07,500
That's why he has no one.

1501
01:56:07,640 --> 01:56:09,240
He fights only for himself.

1502
01:56:13,140 --> 01:56:14,380
What's the matter?

1503
01:56:14,740 --> 01:56:16,600
Are you afraid of me?

1504
01:56:16,820 --> 01:56:20,400
Or are you still thinking of the best way
to save your friends?

1505
01:56:21,080 --> 01:56:21,760
Fool!

1506
01:56:22,040 --> 01:56:23,100
Forget them!

1507
01:56:23,320 --> 01:56:25,140
Think only of yourself!

1508
01:56:25,540 --> 01:56:27,200
Love only yourself!

1509
01:56:27,640 --> 01:56:30,180
That is what it means to be the strongest!

1510
01:56:30,700 --> 01:56:31,700
What's wrong?

1511
01:56:32,060 --> 01:56:34,520
You were so bold and cocky before!

1512
01:56:35,040 --> 01:56:36,900
Show me your strength!

1513
01:56:37,260 --> 01:56:40,720
Let me grind it into dust before your
eyes!

1514
01:56:41,680 --> 01:56:43,100
Attack, you coward!

1515
01:56:43,260 --> 01:56:46,060
Fight me or I'll kill the girl right now!

1516
01:56:48,520 --> 01:56:51,760
Okay, you asked for it!

1517
01:56:51,840 --> 01:56:53,940
Multi-shadow clone jutsu!

1518
01:56:56,700 --> 01:57:02,220
Wind style... sandstorm devastation!

1519
01:57:06,700 --> 01:57:09,180
He just blew him away!

1520
01:57:09,420 --> 01:57:10,420
Not good!

1521
01:57:10,740 --> 01:57:13,740
I think I'll toy with you a while.

1522
01:57:13,980 --> 01:57:16,800
I'll watch you abandon your friends and
friends.

1523
01:57:16,801 --> 01:57:18,820
And beg for mercy before you die.

1524
01:57:25,460 --> 01:57:31,180
What... what the... And again!

1525
01:57:39,070 --> 01:57:40,450
What's this feeling?

1526
01:57:41,970 --> 01:57:43,370
Sand shuriken!

1527
01:57:50,570 --> 01:57:52,430
What's this... this strange feeling?

1528
01:57:53,230 --> 01:57:54,550
Getting stronger!

1529
01:57:55,210 --> 01:57:57,310
He... what's he doing?

1530
01:57:57,750 --> 01:57:59,170
Flowing through me!

1531
01:57:59,490 --> 01:58:02,230
As if I was on fire!

1532
01:58:03,670 --> 01:58:05,170
I see it now!

1533
01:58:05,490 --> 01:58:06,950
I can't lose!

1534
01:58:08,550 --> 01:58:09,550
Weakling!

1535
01:58:11,360 --> 01:58:14,090
I have to beat him, even if it kills me!

1536
01:58:14,510 --> 01:58:16,010
What is this?

1537
01:58:16,290 --> 01:58:18,930
You come at me and that's all you've got?

1538
01:58:18,931 --> 01:58:24,530
All that effort... and you couldn't even
touch me... what a joke!

1539
01:58:27,130 --> 01:58:28,130
Sakura...

1540
01:58:31,870 --> 01:58:37,050
I don't really know how much damage I can
do... but it doesn't matter!

1541
01:58:37,370 --> 01:58:39,390
I just have to give it my best shot!

1542
01:58:39,630 --> 01:58:40,990
Shadow clone jutsu!

1543
01:58:41,410 --> 01:58:41,830
Shadow clone jutsu!

1544
01:58:41,831 --> 01:58:42,831
Shadow clone jutsu!

1545
01:58:43,290 --> 01:58:44,790
Shadow clone jutsu!

1546
01:58:46,370 --> 01:58:47,510
Here goes!

1547
01:58:47,930 --> 01:58:50,390
Get ready for the ultimate secret
taijutsu!

1548
01:58:51,090 --> 01:58:52,390
Naruto's alchemy!

1549
01:58:53,070 --> 01:58:54,650
Clone body slam!

1550
01:59:00,650 --> 01:59:01,070
Okay!

1551
01:59:01,430 --> 01:59:02,710
Let's do it!

1552
01:59:04,150 --> 01:59:05,930
Shadow clone jutsu!

1553
01:59:07,190 --> 01:59:08,230
And another!

1554
01:59:08,570 --> 01:59:10,510
Shadow clone jutsu!

1555
01:59:11,710 --> 01:59:12,810
Take this!

1556
01:59:13,030 --> 01:59:14,690
Leaf village secret taijutsu!

1557
01:59:14,691 --> 01:59:17,230
Straight from the teachings of
Kakashi-sensei!

1558
01:59:17,510 --> 01:59:19,410
A thousand years of death!

1559
01:59:23,630 --> 01:59:24,630
Boom!

1560
01:59:36,530 --> 01:59:40,450
All of that work... and you only scored
one blow?

1561
01:59:41,720 --> 01:59:43,070
Put a sock in it!

1562
01:59:44,690 --> 01:59:48,650
He attacked at the base of the tail,
where the defense is weakest.

1563
01:59:49,330 --> 01:59:53,870
He didn't wound me, but the sand couldn't
absorb the impact.

1564
01:59:55,010 --> 01:59:57,190
Have I underestimated him?

1565
02:00:01,750 --> 02:00:03,350
Naruto, listen to me.

1566
02:00:03,960 --> 02:00:07,990
You have to save Sakura if it's the last
thing you do.

1567
02:00:09,160 --> 02:00:13,730
Once you've got her, I want you to take
her and flee as fast as you can.

1568
02:00:14,690 --> 02:00:15,990
It's all up to you.

1569
02:00:18,940 --> 02:00:22,810
I can... hold him here... a little longer.

1570
02:00:25,805 --> 02:00:27,270
I lost everything once.

1571
02:00:27,905 --> 02:00:30,470
I don't ever want to have to see that
again.

1572
02:00:32,590 --> 02:00:36,150
My trusted comrades falling... right in
front of me.

1573
02:00:37,490 --> 02:00:38,490
Your comrades?

1574
02:00:39,405 --> 02:00:40,405
Sasuke...

1575
02:00:41,210 --> 02:00:44,270
I will not allow my comrades to die.

1576
02:00:44,570 --> 02:00:46,190
That is absolute.

1577
02:00:52,340 --> 02:00:53,920
I get it now.

1578
02:00:57,000 --> 02:00:58,200
Of course.

1579
02:01:01,000 --> 02:01:05,460
Going through life with the exact same
sadness and loneliness that I had to carry?

1580
02:01:06,260 --> 02:01:09,567
He fought only for himself,
never relying on anyone, and

1581
02:01:09,568 --> 02:01:12,120
because of that I thought
that he possessed strength.

1582
02:01:12,680 --> 02:01:14,080
I really did.

1583
02:01:15,680 --> 02:01:17,580
Naruto... I don't know.

1584
02:01:17,740 --> 02:01:19,300
I guess I should have known better.

1585
02:01:19,520 --> 02:01:21,500
That's not what real strength is.

1586
02:01:21,680 --> 02:01:24,391
If you never fight for
anyone but yourself,

1587
02:01:24,392 --> 02:01:27,541
you'll never be strong
no matter what you do.

1588
02:01:29,440 --> 02:01:33,900
The truth is, when a person has something
precious they want to protect,

1589
02:01:37,580 --> 02:01:41,660
it's only then that they become genuinely
strong.

1590
02:01:47,040 --> 02:01:48,520
You will get strong.

1591
02:01:49,140 --> 02:01:50,360
Very strong.

1592
02:01:55,480 --> 02:01:57,800
He's releasing a massive amount of chakra.

1593
02:01:58,800 --> 02:02:01,200
How is he... doing it?

1594
02:02:03,800 --> 02:02:06,180
No matter what happens...

1595
02:02:09,180 --> 02:02:11,980
I swear I'm going to protect you!

1596
02:02:16,140 --> 02:02:19,000
One more attempt!

1597
02:02:21,340 --> 02:02:23,741
One... Two...

1598
02:02:25,620 --> 02:02:27,020
Three!

1599
02:02:28,420 --> 02:02:28,520
Five!

1600
02:02:28,521 --> 02:02:28,680
Six!

1601
02:02:28,681 --> 02:02:30,460
Nine!

1602
02:02:30,620 --> 02:02:31,620
Ten!

1603
02:02:36,940 --> 02:02:38,340
Nineteen!

1604
02:02:38,900 --> 02:02:46,820
Ten... One... Two... Four... Six...
Five... I don't believe my eyes.

1605
02:02:47,360 --> 02:02:49,000
Way to go there, blondie!

1606
02:02:49,140 --> 02:02:50,800
You show an awful lot of promise!

1607
02:02:51,080 --> 02:02:53,100
How did you... do this?

1608
02:02:53,960 --> 02:02:56,400
Sasuke, why don't you take it easy for a
while?

1609
02:02:56,560 --> 02:02:57,560
You deserve it!

1610
02:02:57,600 --> 02:03:00,440
Just leave the rest to Naruto Uzumaki!

1611
02:03:03,000 --> 02:03:04,540
What happened to him?

1612
02:03:05,360 --> 02:03:06,420
Hi, everyone!

1613
02:03:06,920 --> 02:03:07,780
Look out!

1614
02:03:07,880 --> 02:03:08,920
Here I go!

1615
02:03:11,500 --> 02:03:13,780
Unbelievable... Is that... Naruto?

1616
02:03:17,760 --> 02:03:19,400
Let's do this!

1617
02:03:19,800 --> 02:03:24,060
Direct from Naruto's ninja half-arc!

1618
02:03:26,900 --> 02:03:27,900
Everywhere!

1619
02:03:27,940 --> 02:03:28,940
Shuriken!

1620
02:03:30,820 --> 02:03:32,820
My body hasn't recovered yet.

1621
02:03:33,000 --> 02:03:35,140
I have to use the sand to defend!

1622
02:03:41,780 --> 02:03:42,700
Naruto!

1623
02:03:42,701 --> 02:03:43,620
Shuriken!

1624
02:03:43,621 --> 02:03:45,660
Uzumaki Barrage!

1625
02:03:59,820 --> 02:04:01,200
Naruto's Handbook!

1626
02:04:08,300 --> 02:04:13,200
Kid... This time we'll use both
legs for a barrage of 4,000 kicks!

1627
02:04:14,105 --> 02:04:16,660
Where did that strength come from?

1628
02:04:17,320 --> 02:04:21,140
There's no way... Not to him!

1629
02:04:23,270 --> 02:04:28,760
There's absolutely no way... I'm gonna
lose to a guy like him!

1630
02:04:29,480 --> 02:04:30,480
Huh?

1631
02:04:40,600 --> 02:04:43,420
What the... What is that?

1632
02:04:43,421 --> 02:04:44,421
Oh,

1633
02:04:50,680 --> 02:04:52,820
you've forgotten?

1634
02:04:53,540 --> 02:04:54,540
Here it is!

1635
02:04:58,100 --> 02:04:59,760
No, no, no...

1636
02:05:06,480 --> 02:05:07,720
Oh, look at his face!

1637
02:05:08,700 --> 02:05:09,940
Oh, no!

1638
02:05:09,941 --> 02:05:10,660
Look at me!

1639
02:05:10,661 --> 02:05:11,701
I don't like stored items!

1640
02:05:11,780 --> 02:05:13,100
Oh, oh, no!

1641
02:05:13,101 --> 02:05:14,101
Let's see...

1642
02:05:15,260 --> 02:05:16,800
So that's it.

1643
02:05:16,960 --> 02:05:18,360
The monster.

1644
02:05:18,660 --> 02:05:20,040
Inside of him.

1645
02:05:24,280 --> 02:05:25,280
Naruto!

1646
02:05:28,460 --> 02:05:30,220
My body!

1647
02:05:30,480 --> 02:05:34,800
I used up all my chakra on all those
clones!

1648
02:05:40,920 --> 02:05:41,920
Sakura!

1649
02:05:46,100 --> 02:05:50,880
This is the end for
you... SANBURU!

1650
02:05:51,820 --> 02:05:53,040
Sakura!

1651
02:06:02,020 --> 02:06:04,820
I swear I'll protect you!

1652
02:06:09,820 --> 02:06:12,260
Naruto Uzumaki...

1653
02:06:15,560 --> 02:06:19,420
You really are good at amusing me.

1654
02:06:21,040 --> 02:06:24,200
Naruto... how on earth can you do that?

1655
02:06:25,370 --> 02:06:26,540
Not you again!

1656
02:06:26,940 --> 02:06:28,400
What is this?

1657
02:06:29,240 --> 02:06:30,240
Huh?

1658
02:06:30,670 --> 02:06:32,720
Well, will you look at that?

1659
02:06:33,320 --> 02:06:35,400
Shukaku the Sand Spirit.

1660
02:06:36,080 --> 02:06:37,080
What do you say?

1661
02:06:37,765 --> 02:06:39,780
Will you fight alongside me today,
Chief Toad?

1662
02:06:44,370 --> 02:06:45,430
Take a hike.

1663
02:06:45,770 --> 02:06:50,690
Why go out of my way to mess with a guy
like him?

1664
02:06:51,540 --> 02:06:52,650
What am I, an idiot?

1665
02:06:53,070 --> 02:06:53,290
Why?

1666
02:06:53,450 --> 02:06:54,550
Are you kidding me?

1667
02:06:54,630 --> 02:06:57,250
You already told me you would make me your
henchman, didn't you?

1668
02:06:57,745 --> 02:07:00,710
It's only natural a boss would want to
help out his henchman, isn't it?

1669
02:07:01,215 --> 02:07:02,730
Don't you have any sense of duty?

1670
02:07:03,610 --> 02:07:04,610
Yeah, sure.

1671
02:07:04,730 --> 02:07:07,530
I told you I'd make you my henchman.

1672
02:07:08,050 --> 02:07:11,610
But we haven't even sealed the deal over a
couple of weeks.

1673
02:07:11,611 --> 02:07:12,726
And I haven't even had a cup of sake yet.

1674
02:07:12,750 --> 02:07:14,130
Give me a freaking break!

1675
02:07:14,270 --> 02:07:16,030
I'm not even 21 years old yet!

1676
02:07:16,150 --> 02:07:17,430
I can't have any alcohol!

1677
02:07:18,650 --> 02:07:19,670
Come on, Pops.

1678
02:07:19,671 --> 02:07:20,370
Don't be like that.

1679
02:07:20,470 --> 02:07:22,426
Why don't you just settle down and hear
the kid out?

1680
02:07:22,450 --> 02:07:22,670
Huh?

1681
02:07:23,250 --> 02:07:24,250
Pops?

1682
02:07:24,640 --> 02:07:27,730
And just what do you think you're doing
here, Gamakichi?

1683
02:07:28,130 --> 02:07:29,390
I had nothing else to do.

1684
02:07:29,550 --> 02:07:31,250
I just came to hang out.

1685
02:07:31,450 --> 02:07:31,670
Huh?

1686
02:07:31,790 --> 02:07:32,230
Huh?

1687
02:07:32,695 --> 02:07:33,695
Your father and son?

1688
02:07:34,410 --> 02:07:37,310
By the way, Pops, that big ugly lug over
there was picking on me before.

1689
02:07:38,435 --> 02:07:39,435
Come again?

1690
02:07:41,240 --> 02:07:43,890
Oh yeah, and when he did, our friend here
came to my rescue.

1691
02:07:44,760 --> 02:07:46,880
He went head-to-head and toe-to-toe with
that monster.

1692
02:07:47,190 --> 02:07:50,470
I'm telling you, Pops, there's a heck of a
lot more to this kid than meets the eye.

1693
02:07:51,710 --> 02:07:52,970
Is that right?

1694
02:07:54,870 --> 02:07:55,870
Okay, kid.

1695
02:07:56,530 --> 02:07:59,310
You're hereby accepted as my henchman.

1696
02:07:59,950 --> 02:08:00,950
Sit tight.

1697
02:08:01,750 --> 02:08:04,570
I'll show you what duty is all about.

1698
02:08:05,910 --> 02:08:06,350
Whoa!

1699
02:08:06,351 --> 02:08:09,670
Hang on tight, small fry!

1700
02:08:12,170 --> 02:08:14,430
Don't you like that?

1701
02:08:15,270 --> 02:08:16,450
Whoa!

1702
02:08:20,110 --> 02:08:21,290
Awesome!

1703
02:08:38,280 --> 02:08:39,600
This guy's no joke.

1704
02:08:40,140 --> 02:08:43,340
I barely managed to make that cutty so
heavy.

1705
02:08:43,740 --> 02:08:48,640
If I don't end this quick, the landscape's
gonna start changing around here.

1706
02:08:48,920 --> 02:08:49,460
Hey, Chief!

1707
02:08:49,620 --> 02:08:50,620
Hold on a second!

1708
02:08:51,195 --> 02:08:52,475
Don't go over in that direction!

1709
02:08:52,660 --> 02:08:53,660
Sakura's still there!

1710
02:08:53,855 --> 02:08:56,260
Try and lure him over this way if you can,
okay?

1711
02:08:57,119 --> 02:08:58,119
Sakura?

1712
02:08:59,270 --> 02:09:00,550
It's his little girlfriend, Pop.

1713
02:09:00,820 --> 02:09:01,820
Right, kid?

1714
02:09:02,255 --> 02:09:03,460
I have to take him out!

1715
02:09:04,280 --> 02:09:06,400
Otherwise, Sakura's as good as dead!

1716
02:09:07,680 --> 02:09:08,680
Hm-hm-hm.

1717
02:09:12,320 --> 02:09:13,396
Interesting... INTERESTING!

1718
02:09:13,420 --> 02:09:15,800
NOT BAD, MARUTOZO MAKI!

1719
02:09:16,920 --> 02:09:18,020
This isn't good!

1720
02:09:18,580 --> 02:09:19,060
Kana!

1721
02:09:19,460 --> 02:09:20,780
He's really going to do it!

1722
02:09:20,960 --> 02:09:22,180
I have to get out of here!

1723
02:09:42,310 --> 02:09:43,450
He's done it.

1724
02:09:45,320 --> 02:09:46,910
I don't like this at all, Chief Toad.

1725
02:09:47,030 --> 02:09:47,890
What's gonna happen?

1726
02:09:48,050 --> 02:09:48,330
I don't like this at all, Chief Toad.

1727
02:09:48,330 --> 02:09:48,330
What's gonna happen?

1728
02:09:48,800 --> 02:09:56,551
If he's set the Play Possum Jutsu in
motion, then the Shikaku will be unleashed!

1729
02:10:01,390 --> 02:10:03,010
I'm finally free!

1730
02:10:03,510 --> 02:10:04,910
Here I come, baby!

1731
02:10:07,710 --> 02:10:09,110
Here we go!

1732
02:10:09,470 --> 02:10:11,190
I hope you're ready to die!

1733
02:10:11,490 --> 02:10:12,630
Let's do this!

1734
02:10:14,090 --> 02:10:15,670
I'm gonna jump!

1735
02:10:15,671 --> 02:10:16,170
Huh?

1736
02:10:16,490 --> 02:10:19,650
Wind Style... Air Bullets!

1737
02:10:22,190 --> 02:10:24,710
Water Style... Liquid Bullets!

1738
02:10:33,670 --> 02:10:35,250
Oh, this is nice.

1739
02:10:35,510 --> 02:10:36,930
I didn't know it was gonna rain.

1740
02:10:37,290 --> 02:10:39,910
What kind of a battle is this turning
into?

1741
02:10:43,150 --> 02:10:44,250
Remember, Chief!

1742
02:10:44,370 --> 02:10:45,370
Not in that direction!

1743
02:10:45,690 --> 02:10:46,870
Will you shut up?

1744
02:10:46,890 --> 02:10:47,910
I know already!

1745
02:10:49,970 --> 02:10:51,330
Air Bullets!

1746
02:10:52,450 --> 02:10:53,810
Liquid Bullets!

1747
02:10:57,670 --> 02:11:00,130
Too bad... This is bad, Chief!

1748
02:11:00,370 --> 02:11:01,410
There's one more coming!

1749
02:11:02,010 --> 02:11:03,010
No!

1750
02:11:03,890 --> 02:11:03,910
No!

1751
02:11:04,910 --> 02:11:05,910
No!

1752
02:11:09,170 --> 02:11:09,850
No!

1753
02:11:09,851 --> 02:11:09,890
No!

1754
02:11:09,891 --> 02:11:11,130
I did it!

1755
02:11:11,170 --> 02:11:12,210
I killed him!

1756
02:11:12,390 --> 02:11:13,630
I killed him!

1757
02:11:17,490 --> 02:11:19,250
Now that kind of hurt.

1758
02:11:19,890 --> 02:11:24,370
That was an awful lot of chakra that you
blasted me with, I have to admit.

1759
02:11:24,750 --> 02:11:24,830
Hm?

1760
02:11:25,130 --> 02:11:29,330
Hit me with a couple more of those,
even I won't last much longer.

1761
02:11:29,610 --> 02:11:30,670
Chief, what should we do?

1762
02:11:31,030 --> 02:11:37,330
Well, for starters, you can wake up the
spiritualist medium to release that jutsu!

1763
02:11:37,750 --> 02:11:39,250
How am I supposed to do that?

1764
02:11:39,251 --> 02:11:41,950
Just fire off a few rounds at him!

1765
02:11:43,670 --> 02:11:44,710
Liquid Bullets!

1766
02:11:45,570 --> 02:11:46,610
You missed!

1767
02:11:53,090 --> 02:11:54,130
Hey, Chief!

1768
02:11:54,330 --> 02:11:57,330
You're gonna have to keep a grip on him if
you want me to get a shot in!

1769
02:11:57,830 --> 02:12:03,470
My body doesn't have any claws or horns to
dig into the enemy with!

1770
02:12:04,890 --> 02:12:06,870
Then what the heck are we supposed to do?

1771
02:12:06,871 --> 02:12:11,650
Use the transformation jutsu to change
into something that has what we need!

1772
02:12:12,870 --> 02:12:16,850
Then again, I'm not particularly good at
transformations.

1773
02:12:17,610 --> 02:12:17,790
Huh?

1774
02:12:18,090 --> 02:12:19,790
Don't worry about it!

1775
02:12:19,910 --> 02:12:22,870
You shall act upon my will and make a hand
sign!

1776
02:12:23,350 --> 02:12:23,750
What?

1777
02:12:24,210 --> 02:12:26,150
A combined transformation!

1778
02:12:27,070 --> 02:12:28,070
Ah, okay!

1779
02:12:28,570 --> 02:12:31,210
Conjure up something with fangs and claws!

1780
02:12:31,890 --> 02:12:35,050
Let's see, uh... Here we go!

1781
02:12:36,870 --> 02:12:37,030
Hey!

1782
02:12:37,070 --> 02:12:37,390
Hey!

1783
02:12:37,670 --> 02:12:37,890
Hey!

1784
02:12:37,891 --> 02:12:38,891
Wait a second!

1785
02:12:39,190 --> 02:12:40,190
Fangs and claws!

1786
02:12:40,370 --> 02:12:41,090
Fangs and claws!

1787
02:12:41,310 --> 02:12:42,310
Fangs and claws!

1788
02:12:42,590 --> 02:12:43,590
Yeah!

1789
02:12:44,930 --> 02:12:45,930
TRANSFORM!

1790
02:12:54,390 --> 02:12:57,131
That's the... ... ...

1791
02:12:58,630 --> 02:12:59,630
...

1792
02:12:59,870 --> 02:13:01,750
... ...

1793
02:13:31,750 --> 02:13:32,750
...

1794
02:13:47,610 --> 02:13:51,010
He disrupted my jutsu!

1795
02:13:51,970 --> 02:13:52,970
Hmmmmmm!?

1796
02:13:54,470 --> 02:13:55,910
SEND COFFINS!

1797
02:13:56,030 --> 02:13:57,190
Help him, Pops!

1798
02:13:57,350 --> 02:13:58,350
I got him!

1799
02:13:58,950 --> 02:14:00,530
You think I'm a fool?

1800
02:14:11,070 --> 02:14:12,070
Death!

1801
02:14:12,810 --> 02:14:15,670
How much strength does this guy have left?

1802
02:14:16,730 --> 02:14:18,170
This ain't good.

1803
02:14:18,570 --> 02:14:21,930
Naruto and I have already used up all of
our chakra.

1804
02:14:25,870 --> 02:14:28,290
I'll wipe you from the face of the Earth.

1805
02:14:28,470 --> 02:14:30,650
I will not cease to exist!

1806
02:14:47,290 --> 02:14:48,530
At 20!

1807
02:14:56,250 --> 02:14:57,250
21!

1808
02:15:13,090 --> 02:15:14,230
The... Party!

1809
02:15:19,150 --> 02:15:21,670
Kakashi, how many did you take down?

1810
02:15:21,930 --> 02:15:22,930
22.

1811
02:15:23,770 --> 02:15:26,410
Looks like I win another round,
huh buddy?

1812
02:15:28,490 --> 02:15:31,270
That last one I knocked off was my 23rd.

1813
02:15:31,390 --> 02:15:32,390
Yeah, yeah, alright.

1814
02:15:32,890 --> 02:15:35,850
I love that two-cooper-school attitude of
yours!

1815
02:15:36,190 --> 02:15:38,170
That's why you're my number one rival.

1816
02:15:39,130 --> 02:15:39,830
Let's go.

1817
02:15:40,090 --> 02:15:41,090
Alright!

1818
02:15:50,470 --> 02:15:52,770
He still has my arms!

1819
02:15:53,250 --> 02:15:55,150
Can't use an 8-2-2!

1820
02:15:57,170 --> 02:16:00,370
Don't you think it's about time you took a
rest, old man?

1821
02:16:09,670 --> 02:16:15,210
I won't let this village be swallowed up
by your ambition!

1822
02:16:15,990 --> 02:16:18,170
Nothing can stop my ambition!

1823
02:16:18,490 --> 02:16:21,010
You are going to die here!

1824
02:16:21,490 --> 02:16:24,030
I don't care if you are Third Hokage!

1825
02:16:24,031 --> 02:16:26,570
You're nothing but a withered old fool!

1826
02:16:26,850 --> 02:16:30,330
Do you honestly believe you have the
strength needed to stop me now?

1827
02:16:31,950 --> 02:16:37,209
Have you even the slightest idea what's
befalling your precious little village?

1828
02:16:37,549 --> 02:16:41,730
Do not underestimate the shinobi of this
village!

1829
02:16:52,340 --> 02:16:54,200
Not another step!

1830
02:16:54,500 --> 02:16:56,200
You are done here!

1831
02:16:59,219 --> 02:17:00,219
Huh?

1832
02:17:10,969 --> 02:17:11,690
No!

1833
02:17:11,691 --> 02:17:12,691
Sakura!

1834
02:17:13,530 --> 02:17:17,910
You have to save Sakura, if it's the last
thing you do.

1835
02:17:18,090 --> 02:17:21,490
Sakura, I swear I'll protect you!

1836
02:17:22,549 --> 02:17:23,549
Come on!

1837
02:17:27,809 --> 02:17:29,350
I don't need much.

1838
02:17:29,610 --> 02:17:31,049
Just give me... Just give me...

1839
02:17:31,370 --> 02:17:32,370
Just give me...

1840
02:17:36,100 --> 02:17:38,379
Give me some chakra!

1841
02:17:44,400 --> 02:17:51,820
Just give me...

1842
02:18:04,480 --> 02:18:06,040
What are you all waiting for?

1843
02:18:06,160 --> 02:18:07,280
It's just one man!

1844
02:18:18,760 --> 02:18:21,620
The Leaf Village's spirit is strong.

1845
02:18:21,980 --> 02:18:23,520
You'd do well to remember.

1846
02:18:25,520 --> 02:18:27,740
My... my body!

1847
02:18:28,200 --> 02:18:29,780
I can't move!

1848
02:18:32,360 --> 02:18:33,940
Come on, fellas.

1849
02:18:34,260 --> 02:18:37,480
You've never heard of the Shadow Paralysis
Jutsu?

1850
02:18:37,660 --> 02:18:40,000
Then you're going to love this next one.

1851
02:18:41,139 --> 02:18:44,940
The Leaf Village's Shadow Strangle Jutsu.

1852
02:18:49,840 --> 02:18:51,260
Expansion Jutsu!

1853
02:18:58,260 --> 02:19:00,360
Mind Destruction Jutsu!

1854
02:19:04,799 --> 02:19:06,480
What are you doing?

1855
02:19:08,760 --> 02:19:09,760
Stop it!

1856
02:19:10,000 --> 02:19:11,000
Stop!

1857
02:19:18,860 --> 02:19:21,080
Reminds you of the good old days,
doesn't it?

1858
02:19:21,180 --> 02:19:22,320
You bet it does.

1859
02:19:22,321 --> 02:19:25,680
The Inoshikacho Trio is back!

1860
02:19:27,740 --> 02:19:32,639
Let's go, Kuramaru!

1861
02:19:32,820 --> 02:19:33,820
Right!

1862
02:19:34,600 --> 02:19:38,440
Never mind the odds our Leaf Shinobi are
up against.

1863
02:19:38,799 --> 02:19:41,080
They'll lay down their lives for this
village!

1864
02:19:42,639 --> 02:19:45,000
How little you understand!

1865
02:19:46,080 --> 02:19:50,300
Mastering every jutsu will not give you
unsurpassable strength!

1866
02:19:52,300 --> 02:19:57,120
The poison in my body is... The poison
in my body is... Try not to move, Shino!

1867
02:19:57,280 --> 02:19:58,980
I've injected my parasites.

1868
02:19:59,400 --> 02:20:01,140
They're neutralizing the poison.

1869
02:20:02,480 --> 02:20:03,480
Dad...

1870
02:20:05,200 --> 02:20:07,680
It was one of my first lessons.

1871
02:20:08,060 --> 02:20:11,385
It's not until you've
protected someone precious to

1872
02:20:11,386 --> 02:20:14,400
you that the true strength
of the Shinobi can emerge!

1873
02:20:15,240 --> 02:20:16,240
Yes!

1874
02:20:18,440 --> 02:20:21,240
I'm going to protect... everyone!

1875
02:20:24,620 --> 02:20:25,380
I'm going to
protect... everyone!

1876
02:20:25,381 --> 02:20:27,780
Get ready, you crazy monster!

1877
02:20:37,460 --> 02:20:39,360
I've had it with you!

1878
02:21:07,910 --> 02:21:09,510
Did... did he win?

1879
02:21:10,110 --> 02:21:12,290
A plain old headbutt, huh?

1880
02:21:12,950 --> 02:21:16,050
Well, he's not the most elegant fighter
I've ever seen.

1881
02:21:16,370 --> 02:21:20,707
But to dredge up the chakra
he needed, worn out as he was,

1882
02:21:20,708 --> 02:21:23,470
he might be the biggest
knucklehead I've ever come across.

1883
02:21:23,930 --> 02:21:27,570
But I haven't seen a kid with this much
promise in ages.

1884
02:21:28,430 --> 02:21:31,770
Wish I could stick around to see how this
ends.

1885
02:21:32,230 --> 02:21:34,530
But I've reached my limit, too.

1886
02:21:35,950 --> 02:21:38,390
Gamakichi, it's time we went back!

1887
02:21:38,610 --> 02:21:39,390
Okay, Pops.

1888
02:21:39,530 --> 02:21:40,530
Let's do it.

1889
02:21:56,710 --> 02:21:57,210
That's it.

1890
02:21:57,290 --> 02:21:58,290
I can't go any further.

1891
02:21:58,895 --> 02:22:00,570
I've used up all my chakra.

1892
02:22:01,864 --> 02:22:04,350
And from the look of you, so have you.

1893
02:22:05,319 --> 02:22:06,630
You and I are a lot alike.

1894
02:22:07,359 --> 02:22:08,359
More than you know.

1895
02:22:08,890 --> 02:22:10,510
We shouldn't be doing this.

1896
02:22:14,250 --> 02:22:15,470
All right, then.

1897
02:22:15,890 --> 02:22:18,212
You and I both know
I haven't the strength

1898
02:22:18,213 --> 02:22:20,470
left to rip all of your
soul from its shell.

1899
02:22:20,471 --> 02:22:22,890
You and I both know that.

1900
02:22:23,670 --> 02:22:27,590
And yet... your ambitions end here and
now.

1901
02:22:27,990 --> 02:22:28,990
This isn't over!

1902
02:22:29,150 --> 02:22:31,670
There isn't any stopping my ambition.

1903
02:22:32,090 --> 02:22:33,570
Yours is an obsession.

1904
02:22:33,950 --> 02:22:36,590
This need to drown yourself in jutsu.

1905
02:22:36,630 --> 02:22:39,290
And for this transgression you shall be
punished.

1906
02:22:39,770 --> 02:22:42,910
I shall take away all the jutsu you hold
so dear.

1907
02:22:43,290 --> 02:22:44,310
What did you say?

1908
02:22:46,290 --> 02:22:47,290
Uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu!

1909
02:22:52,410 --> 02:22:53,730
Impossible!

1910
02:22:55,010 --> 02:22:56,510
You wouldn't dare!

1911
02:22:59,050 --> 02:23:01,430
The seal is set!

1912
02:23:10,550 --> 02:23:13,810
My... my arms!

1913
02:23:17,010 --> 02:23:17,870
There you have it.

1914
02:23:17,990 --> 02:23:20,330
Your arms are useless to you now.

1915
02:23:20,730 --> 02:23:24,490
And without those arms, you will never
form another hand side.

1916
02:23:25,290 --> 02:23:27,690
Ninjutsu is forever out of your reach!

1917
02:23:28,510 --> 02:23:30,290
You feeble old man!

1918
02:23:30,790 --> 02:23:32,950
Give me back my arms!

1919
02:23:33,370 --> 02:23:36,730
Your foolishness is unparalleled,
Orochimaru.

1920
02:23:36,950 --> 02:23:40,350
My one regret is that I couldn't take you
with me.

1921
02:23:40,850 --> 02:23:42,010
Farewell, disciple.

1922
02:23:42,490 --> 02:23:45,210
May we meet again in the next world.

1923
02:23:46,130 --> 02:23:48,230
You decrepit old man!

1924
02:23:48,570 --> 02:23:49,950
How dare you!

1925
02:23:50,110 --> 02:23:52,490
How dare you take my jutsu from me!

1926
02:24:05,100 --> 02:24:09,580
Where the tree leaves dance, one shall
find flames.

1927
02:24:10,480 --> 02:24:14,100
The fire's shadow will illuminate the
village.

1928
02:24:31,759 --> 02:24:35,450
And once again, tree leaves shall bud
anew.

1929
02:24:42,870 --> 02:24:43,950
...

1930
02:24:49,390 --> 02:24:50,470
...

1931
02:24:51,590 --> 02:24:52,670
...

1932
02:25:00,940 --> 02:25:01,940
Sarutobi!

1933
02:25:03,640 --> 02:25:04,400
Sarutobi!

1934
02:25:04,401 --> 02:25:06,400
Let me remove the blade.

1935
02:25:09,560 --> 02:25:15,120
A fitting end for one who had mastered the
way of the shinobi.

1936
02:25:21,660 --> 02:25:25,460
My arms... ...feel
as if they're on fire.

1937
02:25:25,700 --> 02:25:26,700
Lord Orochimaru!

1938
02:25:27,440 --> 02:25:29,240
Our mission has failed.

1939
02:25:30,260 --> 02:25:31,700
Release the barrier.

1940
02:25:32,120 --> 02:25:33,380
Take me back.

1941
02:25:33,720 --> 02:25:34,080
Right!

1942
02:25:34,600 --> 02:25:35,600
Release!

1943
02:25:43,380 --> 02:25:44,380
Stop them!

1944
02:25:45,700 --> 02:25:46,700
Ninja heart!

1945
02:25:47,180 --> 02:25:48,240
Spider web now!

1946
02:25:48,560 --> 02:25:49,560
Watch out!

1947
02:25:49,900 --> 02:25:50,960
A chakra web!

1948
02:25:51,080 --> 02:25:52,600
And we flew right into it!

1949
02:25:54,800 --> 02:25:55,320
Kakashi!

1950
02:25:55,669 --> 02:25:56,669
They're pulling out!

1951
02:25:56,700 --> 02:25:57,720
We should go after them!

1952
02:25:57,900 --> 02:25:58,900
Wait, guy.

1953
02:25:58,949 --> 02:25:59,949
I'm not so sure.

1954
02:26:00,180 --> 02:26:01,180
That's right.

1955
02:26:01,889 --> 02:26:03,400
Let's not be too hasty.

1956
02:26:03,759 --> 02:26:06,160
If we rush in, we might get snared in
their traps.

1957
02:26:08,120 --> 02:26:12,360
So... you propose that we do nothing,
eh, Kabuto?

1958
02:26:15,840 --> 02:26:17,720
Well, aren't you the clever one.

1959
02:26:19,420 --> 02:26:20,780
Time to call it a day.

1960
02:26:21,540 --> 02:26:23,720
Are you gonna run away from me again?

1961
02:26:24,220 --> 02:26:26,040
That would be too obvious.

1962
02:26:26,360 --> 02:26:30,740
Why should I show my hand when it's so
much more fun keeping you in the dark?

1963
02:26:31,400 --> 02:26:34,720
That eye of yours can't see everything,
can it?

1964
02:26:34,995 --> 02:26:38,200
Unlike the Uchiha clan, you haven't
mastered it yet.

1965
02:26:38,920 --> 02:26:39,920
Oh well.

1966
02:26:51,170 --> 02:26:52,170
Mari...

1967
02:26:57,710 --> 02:26:58,710
Kankuro!

1968
02:27:17,739 --> 02:27:18,739
I'll leave her with you.

1969
02:27:19,740 --> 02:27:22,045
What could it be.

1970
02:27:32,865 --> 02:27:35,080
.. that makes him so strong?

1971
02:27:49,840 --> 02:27:51,340
What are you doing?

1972
02:27:51,540 --> 02:27:53,100
I told you not to talk to him!

1973
02:27:53,320 --> 02:27:54,320
Let's get out of here!

1974
02:27:58,840 --> 02:27:59,800
Watch out!

1975
02:27:59,840 --> 02:28:02,060
It's... it's him again!

1976
02:28:03,440 --> 02:28:05,200
Why don't you just go away?

1977
02:28:05,700 --> 02:28:08,540
Go away, you... you freak!

1978
02:28:09,240 --> 02:28:09,920
Freak!

1979
02:28:09,921 --> 02:28:10,921
Freak!

1980
02:28:23,500 --> 02:28:24,180
Freak!

1981
02:28:24,240 --> 02:28:25,460
Why don't you die?

1982
02:28:25,461 --> 02:28:26,461
Sorry!

1983
02:28:28,180 --> 02:28:29,320
He's a monster!

1984
02:28:29,580 --> 02:28:31,120
Don't even look at him!

1985
02:28:33,540 --> 02:28:35,520
I told you to stay away from him!

1986
02:28:38,720 --> 02:28:39,660
Go away!

1987
02:28:39,661 --> 02:28:40,661
Dwayne!

1988
02:29:04,700 --> 02:29:07,160
It's all a distant memory now.

1989
02:29:07,840 --> 02:29:11,160
Why do I exist, I used to ask myself.

1990
02:29:11,560 --> 02:29:13,260
And then I found out.

1991
02:29:16,040 --> 02:29:19,180
But I knew that something else had been
taken from me.

1992
02:29:19,700 --> 02:29:21,680
Something even more important.

1993
02:29:22,320 --> 02:29:24,700
And that is when I truly despaired.

1994
02:29:25,340 --> 02:29:26,400
My purpose?

1995
02:29:26,780 --> 02:29:30,120
In all the world there was no one who
needed me.

1996
02:29:30,240 --> 02:29:32,080
I was unnecessary.

1997
02:29:34,200 --> 02:29:34,760
No!

1998
02:29:35,220 --> 02:29:36,220
Stay away!

1999
02:29:44,180 --> 02:29:47,060
It's almost unbearable, isn't it?

2000
02:29:48,660 --> 02:29:51,100
The feeling of being all alone.

2001
02:29:54,140 --> 02:29:55,780
I know that feeling.

2002
02:29:56,540 --> 02:29:57,700
I've been there.

2003
02:29:57,880 --> 02:30:00,180
In that dark and lonely place.

2004
02:30:00,880 --> 02:30:03,000
But now there are others.

2005
02:30:03,860 --> 02:30:06,040
Other people who mean a lot to me.

2006
02:30:08,660 --> 02:30:11,680
I care more about them than I do myself.

2007
02:30:11,681 --> 02:30:14,660
And I won't let anyone hurt them.

2008
02:30:15,300 --> 02:30:17,440
That's why I won't ever give up.

2009
02:30:17,700 --> 02:30:19,500
I will stop you.

2010
02:30:19,860 --> 02:30:21,900
Even if I have to kill you.

2011
02:30:22,660 --> 02:30:23,720
But why?

2012
02:30:24,800 --> 02:30:27,620
Why would you do this for anyone but
yourself?

2013
02:30:28,475 --> 02:30:31,040
Because they saved me from myself.

2014
02:30:31,460 --> 02:30:33,760
They rescued me from my loneliness.

2015
02:30:34,120 --> 02:30:37,460
They were the first to accept me for who I
am.

2016
02:30:39,619 --> 02:30:40,780
They're my friends.

2017
02:30:47,380 --> 02:30:52,380
Well, love is... the heart's desire to
serve someone who is precious to you.

2018
02:30:52,460 --> 02:30:53,700
To watch over them.

2019
02:30:53,840 --> 02:30:55,060
Like my sister did.

2020
02:30:55,720 --> 02:30:56,860
For you, Gaara.

2021
02:30:58,960 --> 02:31:02,820
Love... is that the thing that makes him
so strong?

2022
02:31:04,440 --> 02:31:06,020
Naruto, that's enough.

2023
02:31:11,199 --> 02:31:12,820
Look, Sakura's gonna be alright.

2024
02:31:14,099 --> 02:31:15,900
The sand crumbled away, she's free.

2025
02:31:17,484 --> 02:31:19,420
This guy's chakra is all used up.

2026
02:31:20,920 --> 02:31:21,920
That's a relief.

2027
02:31:28,900 --> 02:31:29,900
That's enough.

2028
02:31:31,200 --> 02:31:32,200
It's over.

2029
02:31:32,569 --> 02:31:33,569
But Gaara!

2030
02:31:35,349 --> 02:31:36,540
I never thought I'd see this.

2031
02:31:37,809 --> 02:31:38,460
He's had it.

2032
02:31:38,461 --> 02:31:41,060
Alright, Gaara.

2033
02:31:56,300 --> 02:31:57,590
Who

2034
02:32:01,260 --> 02:32:04,740
knows, Naruto Uzumaki...

2035
02:32:06,439 --> 02:32:09,720
Perhaps even I, someday...

2036
02:32:13,520 --> 02:32:17,001
Tamari... Konkoro... Hm?

2037
02:32:17,720 --> 02:32:18,720
I'm sorry.

2038
02:32:18,960 --> 02:32:19,960
Ah!

2039
02:32:22,880 --> 02:32:24,780
Don't worry about it.

2040
02:32:25,750 --> 02:33:08,290
Goodbye, Akane.

2041
02:33:10,730 --> 02:33:12,910
I still got you.

2042
02:33:12,911 --> 02:33:13,911
But...

2043
02:33:22,470 --> 02:33:24,110
I'm gonna really need to get it done,
too.

2044
02:33:24,970 --> 02:33:25,970
I'll be there.

2045
02:33:25,971 --> 02:33:26,971
I'll be here with you.

2046
02:33:30,390 --> 02:33:31,390
It's raining.

2047
02:33:32,570 --> 02:33:34,410
Even the heavens weep.

2048
02:33:36,710 --> 02:33:42,690
We are gathered here to remember and honor
not only the third Hokage, but all those

2049
02:33:42,691 --> 02:33:47,390
who sacrificed themselves in this battle
so that our village would survive.

2050
02:34:05,570 --> 02:34:07,550
Why did it have to happen?

2051
02:34:08,590 --> 02:34:11,630
Why did someone so good have to die?

2052
02:34:12,130 --> 02:34:13,130
Why?

2053
02:34:44,640 --> 02:34:46,540
Are those for Hayate?

2054
02:34:52,220 --> 02:34:53,220
Better make it quick.

2055
02:34:53,400 --> 02:34:55,620
The Hokage's funeral has already begun.

2056
02:34:57,220 --> 02:34:58,320
And you can go.

2057
02:34:58,340 --> 02:34:59,420
Paying respects to Kakashi?

2058
02:34:59,600 --> 02:35:00,900
Paying respects to Obito?

2059
02:35:01,920 --> 02:35:04,777
Instead of constantly
inventing new excuses for

2060
02:35:04,778 --> 02:35:07,160
being late, why don't you
simply come here earlier?

2061
02:35:10,440 --> 02:35:11,440
I did.

2062
02:35:11,960 --> 02:35:13,660
I've been here since dawn.

2063
02:35:17,469 --> 02:35:21,080
This place makes me think of the mistakes
I've made in the past.

2064
02:35:22,099 --> 02:35:23,560
And I've made so many of them.

2065
02:35:30,950 --> 02:35:32,130
There are two bells.

2066
02:35:32,730 --> 02:35:36,670
And since there are only two...
One of us will get tied to the stump.

2067
02:35:37,170 --> 02:35:39,650
You're pretty quick on the uptake,
Orochimaru.

2068
02:35:40,090 --> 02:35:40,950
All right.

2069
02:35:41,030 --> 02:35:42,290
I've got this one in the bag.

2070
02:35:43,750 --> 02:35:46,210
I want you to come at me with the intent
to kill.

2071
02:35:58,830 --> 02:36:00,930
Well, Jiraiya, looks like I win our last
battle.

2072
02:36:00,931 --> 02:36:01,510
Hey, little wager.

2073
02:36:01,910 --> 02:36:03,790
Enjoy your time on the stump.

2074
02:36:04,110 --> 02:36:07,230
Ah, just shut up, you flat-chested cutting
board!

2075
02:36:07,650 --> 02:36:09,330
What did you say?!

2076
02:36:09,331 --> 02:36:11,150
You annoying little perv!

2077
02:36:11,910 --> 02:36:13,490
Okay, that's enough.

2078
02:36:13,770 --> 02:36:14,990
Enough, Tsunade.

2079
02:36:15,150 --> 02:36:17,030
You and Orochimaru head home.

2080
02:36:29,870 --> 02:36:31,850
You're unbelievable, you know that?

2081
02:36:32,250 --> 02:36:33,750
How can you be a ninja?

2082
02:36:33,910 --> 02:36:37,010
You keep falling for the same obvious
traps over and over again.

2083
02:36:37,290 --> 02:36:40,290
Yeah, but... You could learn a
few things from Orochimaru.

2084
02:36:41,210 --> 02:36:43,430
It's always the same thing with you,
Sensei.

2085
02:36:43,590 --> 02:36:45,270
Orochimaru this and Orochimaru that.

2086
02:36:45,550 --> 02:36:46,550
Hmm?

2087
02:36:47,030 --> 02:36:50,570
The transparency jutsu I use is flawless
when I'm out researching.

2088
02:36:51,670 --> 02:36:55,730
Oh boy, I'm not even sure I want to know
where you are with transparency.

2089
02:36:56,230 --> 02:36:58,030
I haven't been caught peeping yet.

2090
02:36:58,130 --> 02:36:59,510
It's true, I swear!

2091
02:37:01,130 --> 02:37:03,390
All right then, if you're so sure of
yourself.

2092
02:37:04,169 --> 02:37:06,170
I'll have to tag along next time.

2093
02:37:10,225 --> 02:37:12,470
Wow, Sarutobi-sensei, you're a perv.

2094
02:37:26,900 --> 02:37:28,300
Eiruka-sensei...

2095
02:37:30,140 --> 02:37:31,740
Why do they do it?

2096
02:37:31,900 --> 02:37:34,920
Why do people risk their lives for other
people?

2097
02:37:37,820 --> 02:37:42,280
Well... when someone passes away,
it's the end...

2098
02:37:43,260 --> 02:37:50,280
His past and future... all the dreams he
once had... they disappear along with him.

2099
02:37:50,820 --> 02:37:52,820
This is true, even in the present.

2100
02:37:52,821 --> 02:37:58,460
Even if he dies honorably in battle,
as so many have, as Hayate did,

2101
02:37:58,680 --> 02:38:04,300
all the ties that bind him to the living
are severed.

2102
02:38:04,520 --> 02:38:07,580
All but one, the most important of all.

2103
02:38:08,340 --> 02:38:09,340
People.

2104
02:38:11,120 --> 02:38:17,700
Parents, siblings, friends, lovers,
the people who are important to him.

2105
02:38:19,200 --> 02:38:23,696
And these people, the
ones left behind, are joined

2106
02:38:23,697 --> 02:38:27,280
together in a great circle by
their shared memories of him.

2107
02:38:28,040 --> 02:38:30,915
A circle of friendship,
trust and sacrifice

2108
02:38:30,916 --> 02:38:34,220
that grows larger and
stronger as time passes.

2109
02:38:35,580 --> 02:38:37,240
It's hard to explain it.

2110
02:38:37,780 --> 02:38:39,840
We remain in the circle together.

2111
02:38:40,160 --> 02:38:41,640
We have no choice.

2112
02:38:42,260 --> 02:38:43,700
It's important to us.

2113
02:38:45,620 --> 02:38:48,220
So we do it because we have to.

2114
02:38:48,499 --> 02:38:49,499
I get it.

2115
02:38:49,840 --> 02:38:50,840
Sort of.

2116
02:38:54,020 --> 02:38:56,260
Still, I'm sad he's gone.

2117
02:38:56,879 --> 02:38:59,260
Think how sad it would be if he died for
nothing.

2118
02:39:00,609 --> 02:39:02,340
But he left us something priceless.

2119
02:39:04,280 --> 02:39:05,280
Don't worry.

2120
02:39:05,929 --> 02:39:07,500
You'll understand one of these days.

2121
02:39:08,369 --> 02:39:10,340
Hey, gimme some credit.

2122
02:39:10,549 --> 02:39:11,549
That much I'd get.

2123
02:39:21,070 --> 02:39:22,670
Bye, Iruka-sensei!

2124
02:39:22,671 --> 02:39:23,671
See you later!

2125
02:39:23,710 --> 02:39:24,710
Alright.

2126
02:39:25,170 --> 02:39:26,890
Do you see it, Lord Hokage?

2127
02:39:27,590 --> 02:39:29,210
The Will of Fire.

2128
02:39:29,230 --> 02:39:30,790
The Will of Fire is stronger than ever.

2129
02:39:32,510 --> 02:39:35,474
The sparks you left behind
have kindled the flame

2130
02:39:35,475 --> 02:39:38,251
among the young leaves
of the next generation.

2131
02:39:38,530 --> 02:39:40,550
A mighty flame, Lord Hokage.

2132
02:39:41,150 --> 02:39:45,459
It will burn brightly, and it
will shine its light upon our

2133
02:39:45,460 --> 02:39:49,710
village, and keep it warm and
safe for many years to come.

2134
02:39:54,510 --> 02:40:00,390
And some day, out of that new
flame will come... I'm a new Okage.

2135
02:40:59,230 --> 02:41:07,230
I'm a new Okage.

2136
02:41:07,930 --> 02:41:09,390
I'm a new Okage.

2137
02:41:09,530 --> 02:41:11,530
I'm a new Okage.

2138
02:41:19,490 --> 02:41:27,490
I'm a new Okage.

